eg,#0E0C36_13.36%,#401842_85.48%)] font-sans "><div class="mx-auto py-8 z-1 xl:py-[120px] lg:py-[96px] md:py-[90px] xxl:!max-w-screen-xl xl:!max-w-[94%] md:!max-w-[94%] text-main-white flex items-start flex-col md:flex-row gap-y-9 gap-x-24"><div class="flex-[1_1_100%] md:flex-[1_1_50%]"><h1 class="base-sub-header  mb-5"><span class="text-orange-550">Reduce Your Cost of Ownership</span> by Purchasing in Volume.</h1><p class="text_24 font-400 leading-normal mb-9 md:mb-12 xl:mb-14">Volume licensing simplifies purchasing, lowers per-license costs, and scales across Foxit PDF Editor and Foxit eSign.</p><div class="grid !text_18 leading-normal grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-9"><div><h2 class="text_18 leading-normal font-700  mb-3 md:mb-4">Management benefits</h2><ul class="space-y-3 md:space-y-4 leading-normal font-400"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><span class="size-4 md:size-5 flex-[0_0_auto] text-orange-550 stroke-orange-550 mt-1" style="display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px"></span><span class="text-grey-350">Save resources by placing only one purchase order.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><span class="size-4 md:size-5 flex-[0_0_auto] text-orange-550 stroke-orange-550 mt-1" style="display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px"></span><span class="text-grey-350">Centrally purchase, deploy, and manage multiple Foxit PDF Editor and Foxit eSign licenses.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><span class="size-4 md:size-5 flex-[0_0_auto] text-orange-550 stroke-orange-550 mt-1" style="display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px"></span><span class="text-grey-350">Simplify licensing across your organization.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><span class="size-4 md:size-5 flex-[0_0_auto] text-orange-550 stroke-orange-550 mt-1" style="display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px"></span><span class="text-grey-350">Achieve budget predictability.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><span class="size-4 md:size-5 flex-[0_0_auto] text-orange-550 stroke-orange-550 mt-1" style="display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px"></span><span class="text-grey-350">Applies to perpetual and subscription licensing.</span></li></ul></div><div><h2 class="text_18 leading-normal font-700  mb-3 md:mb-4">Operating benefits</h2><ul class="space-y-3 md:space-y-4 leading-normal font-400"><li class="flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><span class="size-4 md:size-5 flex-[0_0_auto] text-orange-550 stroke-orange-550 mt-1" style="display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px"></span><span class="text-grey-350">Enable IT to build standardized installation images.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><span class="size-4 md:size-5 flex-[0_0_auto] text-orange-550 stroke-orange-550 mt-1" style="display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px"></span><span class="text-grey-350">Keep track of installations throughout the month/quarter.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><span class="size-4 md:size-5 flex-[0_0_auto] text-orange-550 stroke-orange-550 mt-1" style="display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px"></span><span class="text-grey-350">Include divisions, subsidiaries, and peers worldwide.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2 md:gap-3"><span class="size-4 md:size-5 flex-[0_0_auto] text-orange-550 stroke-orange-550 mt-1" style="display:inline-block;width:24px;height:24px"></span><span class="text-grey-350">Comply with legal usage obligations.</span></li></ul></div></div><img alt="logos" loading="lazy" width="692" height="52.55" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full object-contain mt-9 md:mt-12 xl:mt-14" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image/?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogob.12fbc572.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=100 1x, /_next/image/?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogob.12fbc572.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100 2x" src="/_next/image/?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fmedia%2Flogob.12fbc572.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=100"/></div><div class="w-full md:fle