nformance Report | Foxit\":\"Foxit PDF Editor \u0026 Reader for Mac Accessibility Conformance Report | Foxit\",\"Review the Foxit PDF Editor and PDF Reader for Mac Accessibility Conformance Report, including VPAT, WCAG 2.1, Section 508, and EN 301 549 accessibility compliance information.\":\"Review the Foxit PDF Editor and PDF Reader for Mac Accessibility Conformance Report, including VPAT, WCAG 2.1, Section 508, and EN 301 549 accessibility compliance information.\",\"Free Online PDF Editor | Edit PDF Files Effortlessly with Foxit\":\"Edit PDFs with Free Online PDF Editor | Foxit\",\"Foxit's free online PDF editor enables quick PDF editing, eSigning, and redaction with AI-powered tools, offering secure and efficient document management for businesses.\":\"Edit PDFs easily using Foxit free online PDF editor. Add text, comments, highlight, annotate, fill \u0026 sign forms, insert images, and more in seconds.\",\"Podcast | Foxit\":\"Podcast | Foxit\",\"The Podcast on All Things PDF. Interviews and discussions with PDF subject matter experts. Industry Case Studies, Document Security, User Stories, ISO Standards, PDF features.\":\"The Podcast on All Things PDF. Interviews and discussions with PDF subject matter experts. Industry Case Studies, Document Security, User Stories, ISO Standards, PDF features.\",\"Foxit Volume Licensing: Bulk PDF Editor \u0026 eSign Savings | Foxit\":\"Foxit Volume Licensing: Bulk PDF Editor \u0026 eSign Savings | Foxit\",\"Unlock enterprise savings with Foxit volume licensing for PDF Editor and eSign. Benefit from bulk pricing discounts, centralized license management, and scalable deployment. Get your quote today!\":\"Unlock enterprise savings with Foxit volume licensing for PDF Editor and eSign. Benefit from bulk pricing discounts, centralized license management, and scalable deployment. Get your quote today!\",\"Resource Hub | Foxit\":\"Resource Hub | Foxit\",\"Download Complete – PDF Editor | Foxit\":\"Download Complete – PDF Editor | Foxit\",\"Your download is ready. Start editing, converting, and managing PDFs with Foxit PDF Editor.\":\"Your download is ready. Start editing, converting, and managing PDFs with Foxit PDF Editor.\",\"G2 Special Offer: Foxit PDF Editor Discount \u0026 Promo Deals | Foxit\":\"G2 Special Offer: Foxit PDF Editor Discount \u0026 Promo Deals | Foxit\",\"Save big on Foxit PDF Editor with our exclusive G2 special offer. Get limited-time discounts, promo codes, and premium features for seamless PDF editing.\":\"Save big on Foxit PDF Editor with our exclusive G2 special offer. Get limited-time discounts, promo codes, and premium features for seamless PDF editing.\",\"IDC Analyst Brief: The Power of AI | Foxit\":\"IDC Analyst Brief: The Power of AI | Foxit\",\"Discover how AI transforms document workflows, boosting productivity and collaboration across enterprises.\":\"Discover how AI transforms document workflows, boosting productivity and collaboration across enterprises.\",\"Quick PDF Library Software License Agreement | Foxit\":\"Quick PDF Library Software License Agreement | Foxit\",\"Review the Quick PDF Library Software License Agreement, including licensing terms, usage rights, restrictions, warranties, support provisions, and liability limitations.\":\"Review the Quick PDF Library Software License Agreement, including licensing terms, usage rights, restrictions, warranties, support provisions, and liability limitations.\",\"Escape from Adobe — Displace Acrobat, Earn 10% Margin | Foxit\":\"Escape from Adobe — Displace Acrobat, Earn 10% Margin | Foxit\",\"Exclusive Foxit reseller promotion: move your client off Adobe Acrobat for up to 60% off, stack partner incentives to 10% margin, and lock deal protection. Registration closes December 15, 2026.\":\"Exclusive Foxit reseller promotion: move your client off Adobe Acrobat for up to 60% off, stack partner incentives to 10% margin, and lock deal protection. Registration closes December 15, 2026.\",\"Bank Document Management \u0026 Automation Software | Foxit\":\"Bank Document Management \u0026 Automation Software | Foxit\",\"Prepare lending documents, collect signatures, manage vendor agreements, and automate records processing with Foxit PDF Editor+, eSign, and Agreements.\":\"Prepare lending documents, collect signatures, manage vendor agreements, and automate records processing with Foxit PDF Editor+, eSign, and Agreements.\",\"Government Document Management Software | Foxit\":\"Government Document Management Software | Foxit\",\"Review public records, publish accessible forms, redact sensitive information, digitize paper backlogs, and collect signatures with Foxit.\":\"Review public records, publish accessible forms, redact sensitive information, digitize paper backlogs, and collect signatures with Foxit.\",\"Healthcare PDF and eSignature Software | Foxit\":\"Healthcare PDF and eSignature Software | Foxit\",\"Prepare scanned healthcare PDFs, collect appropriate eSignatures, redact sensitive information, and scale document processing with Foxit.\":\"Prepare scanned healthcare PDFs, collect appropriate eSignatures, redact sensitive information, and scale document processing with Foxit.\",\"Insurance Document Management Software | Foxit\":\"Insurance Document Management Software | Foxit\",\"Prepare policy documents, collect signatures, review claim files, protect sensitive information, and automate high-volume insurance records processing.\":\"Prepare policy documents, collect signatures, review claim files, protect sensitive information, and automate high-volume insurance records processing.\",\"Legal Document Management Software for Law Firms | Foxit\":\"Legal Document Management Software for Law Firms | Foxit\",\"Prepare case files, redact sensitive information, collect signatures, and manage contract obligations with Foxit software for law firms and legal teams.\":\"Prepare case files, redact sensitive information, collect signatures, and manage contract obligations with Foxit software for law firms and legal teams.\",\"Manufacturing Document Management Software | Foxit\":\"Manufacturing Document Management Software | Foxit\",\"Keep specifications, work instructions, quality records, and supplier agreements accurate with Foxit PDF Editor+, Agreements, and Enterprise Automation.\":\"Keep specifications, work instructions, quality records, and supplier agreements accurate with Foxit PDF Editor+, Agreements, and Enterprise Automation.\",\"Construction Document Management Software | Foxit\":\"Construction Document Management Software | Foxit\",\"Mark up drawing sets with custom symbols, keep revision page labels in order, and measure from the sheet with Foxit PDF Editor+ on Windows.\":\"Mark up drawing sets with custom symbols, keep revision page labels in order, and measure from the sheet with Foxit PDF Editor+ on Windows.\",\"PDF Editor for Students \u0026 Universities | Foxit\":\"PDF Editor for Students \u0026 Universities | Foxit\",\"Get Foxit PDF Editor+ for Education at $49.99/year: full PDF editing, eSign, and AI tools for eligible students, faculty, and staff.\":\"Get Foxit PDF Editor+ for Education at $49.99/year: full PDF editing, eSign, and AI tools for eligible students, faculty, and staff.\",\"PDF and eSign Discounts for Nonprofits | Foxit\":\"PDF and eSign Discounts for Nonprofits | Foxit\",\"Eligible nonprofits, charities, and libraries can save up to 68% on Foxit PDF editing, eSign, and document tools through TechSoup.\":\"Eligible nonprofits, charities, and libraries can save up to 68% on Foxit PDF editing, eSign, and document tools through TechSoup.\",\"*********************  meta  ************************end\":\"\",\"Start 90-Day Free Trial\":\"Start 90-Day Free Trial\",\"\u003cnewLabel\u003eNew:\u003c/newLabel\u003e Contracts stuck in email and spreadsheets? Meet Foxit Agreements. \u003cctaLink\u003eLearn More\u003c/ctaLink\u003e\":\"\u003cnewLabel\u003eNew:\u003c/newLabel\u003e Contracts stuck in email and spreadsheets? Mee