rt free trial\":\"Start free trial\",\"Workspace\":\"Workspace\",\"Workspace turns source documents into reports, slides, and diagrams — ready to edit, not just read.\":\"Workspace turns source documents into reports, slides, and diagrams — ready to edit, not just read.\",\"Organize, analyze, and act on your documents in one AI-powered workspace built to turn scattered information into clear insights and faster action.\":\"Organize, analyze, and act on your documents in one AI-powered workspace built to turn scattered information into clear insights and faster action.\",\"New · AI\":\"New · AI\",\"Download the free app\":\"Download the free app\",\"Foxit Agreements\":\"Foxit Agreements\",\"Create, negotiate, and manage agreements in one workflow while tracking obligations, renewals, compliance, and key details from draft to signature.\":\"Create, negotiate, and manage agreements in one workflow while tracking obligations, renewals, compliance, and key details from draft to signature.\",\"Cloud\":\"Cloud\",\"Foxit eSign\":\"Foxit eSign\",\"Send, sign, and manage agreements through secure eSignature workflows.\":\"Send, sign, and manage agreements through secure eSignature workflows.\",\"Foxit PDF Reader\":\"Foxit PDF Reader\",\"Read, annotate, and collaborate on PDFs with a fast, free PDF reader.\":\"Read, annotate, and collaborate on PDFs with a fast, free PDF reader.\",\"Free\":\"Free\",\"Summarize, translate, search, and chat with PDFs for faster answers.\":\"Summarize, translate, search, and chat with PDFs for faster answers.\",\"Find and permanently remove sensitive information with AI redaction.\":\"Find and permanently remove sensitive information with AI redaction.\",\"Maestro Server OCR\":\"Maestro Server OCR\",\"Turn scanned archives into searchable documents.\":\"Turn scanned archives into searchable documents.\",\"Turn Documents Into Deliverables\":\"Turn Documents Into Deliverables\",\"PDF Compressor\":\"PDF Compressor\",\"Reduce file size without sacrificing quality.\":\"Reduce file size without sacrificing quality.\",\"Rendition Server\":\"Rendition Server\",\"Convert business files into standardized PDFs.\":\"Convert business files into standardized PDFs.\",\"Smart Redact Server\":\"Smart Redact Server\",\"Batch-redact sensitive data across your systems.\":\"Batch-redact sensitive data across your systems.\",\"Featured Products\":\"Featured Products\",\"Document Productivity\":\"Document Productivity\",\"Document Intelligence\":\"Document Intelligence\",\"Enterprise Automation\":\"Enterprise Automation\",\"Compare\":\"Compare\",\"Admin Console\":\"Admin Console\",\"Explore All Products\":\"Explore All Products\",\"Download Foxit PDF Editor Mobile for iOS\":\"Get Foxit PDF Editor Mobile on Apple App Store\",\"Download Foxit PDF Editor Mobile for Android\":\"Get Foxit PDF Editor Mobile on Google Play\",\"FEATURED\":\"FEATURED\",\"Smarter Document Management\":\"Smarter Document Management\",\"Unified document management with centralized storage, security, and governance in a single hub.\":\"Unified document management with centralized storage, security, and governance in a single hub.\",\"Explore Foxit DMS\":\"Explore Foxit DMS\",\"******************** header-menu/products ********************end\":\"\",\"******************** header-menu/developers ********************start\":\"\",\"Foxit Developer SDKs\":\"Foxit Developer SDKs\",\"Build document features into web, desktop, mobile, and server applications with Foxit's cross-platform PDF SDKs.\":\"Build document features into web, desktop, mobile, and server applications with Foxit's cross-platform PDF SDKs.\",\"Web, Mobile \u0026 Server\":\"Web, Mobile \u0026 Server\",\"Explore SDKs\":\"Explore SDKs\",\"Foxit APIs\":\"Foxit APIs\",\"Add PDF processing, document generation, embedded viewing, and eSignature workflows through scalable cloud APIs.\":\"Add PDF processing, document generation, embedded viewing, and eSignature workflows through scalable cloud APIs.\",\"C