gn Business\",\"Buy with Foxit eSign Essentials\":\"Buy with Foxit eSign Essentials\",\"Buy with Foxit PDF Editor+\":\"Buy with Foxit PDF Editor+\",\"Featured Platforms:\":\"Featured Platforms:\",\"Foxit Connectors\":\"Foxit Connectors\",\"The Connectors you purchased will give you \\\"credits\\\" to be spent by selecting your Connectors in the eSign.\":\"The Connectors you purchased will give you \\\"credits\\\" to be spent by selecting your Connectors in the eSign.\",\"License assigned to 1 dedicated user. Cannot be reassigned. Cannot be managed by AC.\":\"License assigned to 1 dedicated user. Cannot be reassigned. Cannot be managed by AC.\",\"* Additional charges apply for Foxit Connectors.\":\"* Additional charges apply for Foxit Connectors.\",\"Up to 40 popular platforms\":\"Up to 40 popular platforms\",\"Foxit Connectors are designed to work in tandem with Foxit eSign or Foxit PDF Editor+. Please go back to the previous step to add the combo product and continue.\":\"Foxit Connectors are designed to work in tandem with Foxit eSign or Foxit PDF Editor+. Please go back to the previous step to add the combo product and continue.\",\"The total number of licenses you are managing in the Admin Console.\":\"The total number of licenses you are managing in the Admin Console.\",\"Determines which region's data center is used to save your usage data.\":\"Determines which region's data center is used to save your usage data.\",\"The list of regions is limited to align with your previous purchase of Foxit PDF Editor+ for data alignment purposes.\":\"The list of regions is limited to align with your previous purchase of Foxit PDF Editor+ for data alignment purposes.\",\"The list of regions is limited to align with your Foxit Account for data alignment purposes.\":\"The list of regions is limited to align with your Foxit Account for data alignment purposes.\",\"*********************Smart Redact Service************************end\":\"\",\"Special Offer for Users\":\"Special Offer for \u003clogo\u003e\u003c/logo\u003e Users\",\"Buy now to get 20% off your first year when you purchase 10-30 licenses.\":\"Buy now to get \u003chighlighted\u003e20% off your first year\u003c/highlighted\u003e when you purchase \u003chighlighted\u003e10-30 licenses.\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Sign in to your Foxit account required. Your files will be securely handled by Foxit servers. By using this service, you agree to Foxit's AI User Guidelines and Privacy Policy. Learn more about Foxit AI Assistant's Security and Privacy.\":\"Sign in to your Foxit account required. Your files will be securely handled by Foxit servers. By using this service, you agree to Foxit's \u003clink_ai_user_guidelines\u003eAI User Guidelines\u003c/link_ai_user_guidelines\u003e and \u003clink_privacy_policy\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/link_privacy_policy\u003e. Learn more about Foxit AI Assistant's \u003clink_ai_assistant\u003eSecurity and Privacy\u003c/link_ai_assistant\u003e.\",\"For additional details see our AI Credit Usage Policy page.\":\"For additional details see our \u003chighlighted\u003eAI Credit Usage Policy page\u003c/highlighted\u003e.\",\"At Foxit, your privacy is our top priority. Our AI solutions are built with robust security protocols to ensure that your data is processed securely and is not retained after use. For detailed information on our data protection and privacy practices, please refer to https://www.foxit.com/company/ai-assistant-security-privacy/.\":\"At Foxit, your privacy is our top priority. Our AI solutions are built with robust security protocols to ensure that your data is processed securely and is not retained after use. For detailed information on our data protection and privacy practices, please refer to \u003chighlighted\u003ehttps://www.foxit.com/{{locale}}/company/ai-assistant-security-privacy/\u003c/highlighted\u003e.\",\"Foxit PDF AI Assistant\":\"Foxit PDF \u003chighlighted\u003eAI Assistant\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"New and Trending From Foxit\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eNew and Trending\u003c/highlighted\u003e From Foxit\",\"Try It Today with Foxit PDF Editor+\":\"Try It Today with \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit PDF Editor+\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Video Tutorials\":\"Video \u003chighlighted\u003eTutorials\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"AI-Driven Productivity for Smarter Workflows\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eAI-Driven Productivity\u003c/highlighted\u003e for Smarter Workflows\",\"Learn How AI Can Boost Productivity By 61%\":\"Learn How AI Can \u003chighlighted\u003eBoost Productivity By 61%\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Includes Access to Foxit Workspace:\":\"Includes Access to \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit Workspace\u003c/highlighted\u003e:\",\"Save 12+ hours per week with AI-powered summarization—Gain time to focus on strategy, decision-making, and the work that truly matters.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eSave 12+ hours per week with AI-powered summarization—\u003c/highlighted\u003eGain time to focus on strategy, decision-making, and the work that truly matters.\",\"Powerful AI Solutions to Enhance Workflows\":\"Powerful AI Solutions\u003cbr/\u003eto \u003chighlighted\u003eEnhance Workflows\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"PDF AI Assistant\":\"PDF AI Assistant\",\"Smart Redact\":\"Smart Redact\",\"AI for Admin Console\":\"AI for \u003chighlighted\u003eAdmin Console\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Foxit AI Privacy and Security\":\"Foxit AI Privacy and\u003cbr/\u003eSecurity\",\"Get Started with Foxit AI Tools\":\"Get Started with \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit AI Tools\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"For a comprehensive overview, refer to our Foxit AI Assistant Security Webpage\":\"For a comprehensive overview, refer to our \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit AI Assistant Security Webpage\u003c/highlighted\u003e.\",\"************************SmartRedact************************start\":\"\",\"highlighted Smart Redact - AI PDF Redaction Software\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eSmart Redact\u003c/highlighted\u003e \u003cbr\u003eAI PDF Redaction Software\",\"AI-Powered PII Redaction in One Click\":\"\u003cp\u003eAI-Powered PII Redaction in One Click\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Automatically detect and remove sensitive data like names, addresses, and IDs without templates or manual review. Built into Foxit PDF Editor for seamless, secure redaction.\":\"Automatically detect and remove sensitive data like names, addresses, and IDs without templates or manual review. Built into Foxit PDF Editor for seamless, secure redaction.\",\"Achieve Unmatched Efficiency with 99.9% Accuracy Using AI\":\"Achieve Unmatched Efficiency \u003cbr\u003e\u003chighlighted\u003ewith 99.9% Accuracy Using AI\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"highlighted Redact Sensitive PII in PDFs with AI Efficiency\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eRedact Sensitive PII in PDFs \u003c/highlighted\u003e with AI Efficiency\",\"highlighted Smart Redact FAQ\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eSmart Redact\u003c/highlighted\u003e FAQ\",\"How many documents comes with Smart Redact?\":\"How many documents comes with Smart Redact?\",\"Once Editor+ is purchased, users receive a quota of 50 documents. After exceeding this limit, additional plans are available through in-app purchase:\":\"Once Editor+ is purchased, users receive a quota of 50 documents. After exceeding this limit, additional plans are available through in-app purchase:\",\"Standard - 200 docs/year\":\"Standard - 200 docs/year\",\"Pro - 1,000 docs/year\":\"Pro - 1,000 docs/year\",\"Enterprise - 2,400 docs/year\":\"Enterprise - 2,400 docs/year\",\"Is Smart Redact secure?\":\"Is Smart Redact secure?\",\"Yes. Foxit Smart Redact ensures top-tier data protection with TAA compliance and SOC2 certification, so your information remains secure. Hosted on Azure and safeguarded with AES-256 encryption, all data transmissions between the Foxit cloud and our PDF Editor are fully protected. After the analysis is complete, files are securely processed in the cloud for redaction. Once redaction is finished, all files are automatically deleted, ensuring they are no longer accessible.\":\"Yes. Foxit Smart Redact ensures top-tier data protection with TAA compliance and SOC2 certification, so your information remains secure. Hosted on Azure and safeguarded with AES-256 encryption, all data transmissions between the Foxit cloud and our PDF Editor are fully protected. After the analysis is complete, files are securely processed in the cloud for redaction. Once redaction is finished, all files are automatically deleted, ensuring they are no longer accessible.\",\"Do I need a PDF Editor+ subscription to use Smart Redact?\":\"Do I need a PDF Editor+ subscription to use Smart Redact?\",\"Yes. Smart Redact is only available with a Foxit PDF Editor+ subscription. If you're using the standard version of Foxit PDF Editor or a perpetual license, you won't see the Smart Redact feature. Is it time for an upgrade? Login to your account or contact a sales rep today!\":\"Yes. Smart Redact is only available with a Foxit PDF Editor+ subscription. If you're using the standard version of Foxit PDF Editor or a perpetual license, you won't see the Smart Redact feature. Is it time for an upgrade? Login to your account or contact a sales rep today!\",\"What types of data can Smart Redact detect?\":\"What types of data can Smart Redact detect?\",\"Smart Redact can automatically detect personally identifiable information (PII) like names, Social Security numbers, phone numbers, emails, credit card details, and more. You can also set up custom keywords or phrases to target anything else specific to your documents.\":\"Smart Redact can automatically detect personally identifiable information (PII) like names, Social Security numbers, phone numbers, emails, credit card details, and more. You can also set up custom keywords or phrases to target anything else specific to your documents.\",\"Can I preview what gets redacted before it's final?\":\"Can I preview what gets redacted before it's final?\",\"Absolutely. Smart Redact gives you a full preview of suggested redactions before anything is applied. You can review, edit, or remove items — so you stay in control of what gets blacked out.\":\"Absolutely. Smart Redact gives you a full preview of suggested redactions before anything is applied. You can review, edit, or remove items — so you stay in control of what gets blacked out.\",\"highlighted Try It Today \u003cbr\u003ewith Foxit PDF Editor+\":\"Try It Today with \u003cbr\u003e\u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit PDF Editor+\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"************************SmartRedact************************end\":\"\",\"************************SmartPrompts************************start\":\"\",\"For more information, visit our Security and Privacy page at: https://www.foxit.com/company/ai-assistant-security-privacy/\":\"For more information, visit our Security and Privacy page at: \u003clinkto\u003ehttps://www.foxit.com/{{locale}}/company/ai-assistant-security-privacy/\u003c/linkto\u003e\",\"************************SmartPrompts************************end\":\"\",\"Translate PDF\":\"Translate PDF\",\"*********************ai/credits-usage-policy/*********************start\":\"\",\"AI Credit Usage Policy\":\"AI Credit \u003chighlighted\u003eUsage Policy\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Foxit AI Assistant and Foxit Workspace utilizes a credit-based system for interactions with AI-powered tools. Credits are deducted based on usage, including submitting text prompts, selecting suggested prompts, or using AI-powered features within the defined limits.\":\"Foxit AI Assistant and Foxit Workspace utilizes a credit-based system for interactions with AI-powered tools. Credits are deducted based on usage, including submitting text prompts, selecting suggested prompts, or using AI-powered features within the defined limits.\",\"Foxit AI Assistant, available within Foxit Editor subscriptions and Foxit Reader, and Foxit Workspace utilize a credit-based system for interactions with AI-powered tools. Credits are deducted based on usage, including submitting text prompts, selecting suggested prompts, or using AI-powered features within the defined limits. Credit consumption is based on the complexity of the task, the user prompt, and the document size, so a single task will not always consume the same number of credits.\":\"Foxit AI Assistant, available within Foxit Editor subscriptions and Foxit Reader, and \u003cworkspace\u003eFoxit Workspace\u003c/workspace\u003e utilize a credit-based system for interactions with AI-powered tools. Credits are deducted based on usage, including submitting text prompts, selecting suggested prompts, or using AI-powered features within the defined limits. Credit consumption is based on the complexity of the task, the user prompt, and the document size, so a single task will not always consume the same number of credits.\",\"Credit Allocation\":\"Credit \u003chighlighted\u003eAllocation\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Foxit AI Assistant in our subscription Reader and Editor productions, along with our standalone AI platform Foxit Workspace, share a common credit pool. Credit allocation is as follows:\":\"Foxit AI Assistant in our subscription Reader and Editor productions, along with our standalone AI platform Foxit Workspace, share a common credit pool. Credit allocation is as follows:\",\"Foxit AI Assistant in our subscription Editor and Reader products, along with Foxit Workspace, share a common credit pool. Credit allocation is as follows:\":\"Foxit AI Assistant in our subscription Editor and Reader products, along with Foxit Workspace, share a common credit pool. Credit allocation is as follows:\",\"Free Credits: 20 free credits per month.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eFree Credits:\u003c/highlighted\u003e 20 free credits per month.\",\"Free Credits: 300 free credits per month.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eFree Credits:\u003c/highlighted\u003e 300 free credits per month.\",\"Paid Credits: 2,000 credits per month.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003ePaid Credits:\u003c/highlighted\u003e 2,000 credits per month.\",\"AI Extra Credit Pack: 1,000 additional credits available for purchase. Available only to users with an active AI subscription. Extra Credit Pack credits do not reset monthly and roll over month to month, and do not expire unless the user cancels their AI subscription.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eAI Extra Credit Pack:\u003c/highlighted\u003e 1,000 additional credits available for purchase. Available only to users with an active AI subscription. Extra Credit Pack credits do not reset monthly and roll over month to month, and do not expire unless the user cancels their AI subscription.\",\"Credit Usage by Feature\":\"Credit Usage by \u003chighlighted\u003eFeature\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Credit consumption is tied to the actual cost of each task rather than a fixed amount per action. Since not every feature costs the same number of credits, usage will vary by feature, by prompt, and by document size. Users can review their detailed credit usage at any time under \u003cbold\u003eSettings \u003e Usage\u003c/bold\u003e.\":\"Credit consumption is tied to the actual cost of each task rather than a fixed amount per action. Since not every feature costs the same number of credits, usage will vary by feature, by prompt, and by document size. Users can review their detailed credit usage at any time under \u003cbold\u003eSettings \u003e Usage\u003c/bold\u003e.\",\"File Limitations\":\"File \u003chighlighted\u003eLimitations\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Supports upload of PDF, PNG, and JPG files.\":\"Supports upload of PDF, PNG, and JPG files.\",\"PDFs have no MB file size limit; up to 2,000 pages can be processed.\":\"PDFs have no MB file size limit; up to 2,000 pages can be processed.\",\"Images are limited to 20 MB and must be PNG or JPG.\":\"Images are limited to 20 MB and must be PNG or JPG.\",\"Up to 100 files per project.\":\"Up to 100 files per project.\",\"Each file can be up to 100 MB or 2,000 pages.\":\"Each file can be up to 100 MB or 2,000 pages.\",\"Up to 1 GB total storage per project.\":\"Up to 1 GB total storage per project.\",\"No file count or per-file size limit. PDFs support up to 2,000 pages per file.\":\"No file count or per-file size limit. PDFs support up to 2,000 pages per file.\",\"Supported formats: PDF, Word, Excel, PPT, URL, TXT, MD, JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP, and SVG.\":\"Supported formats: PDF, Word, Excel, PPT, URL, TXT, MD, JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP, and SVG.\",\"Foxit PDF Editor Subscription Models and PDF Reader\":\"Foxit PDF Editor Subscription Models and PDF Reader\",\"Each AI Assistant action that is executed uses a 1 credit, regardless of the complexity or length of the task.\":\"Each AI Assistant action that is executed uses a 1 credit, regardless of the complexity or length of the task.\",\"Foxit Workspace\":\"Foxit Workspace\",\"Each prompt/question submitted depletes 1 credit.\":\"Each prompt/question submitted depletes 1 credit.\",\"Additional Notes\":\"Additional \u003chighlighted\u003eNotes\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Foxit AI Assistant is currently an add-on feature available for use within Foxit PDF Editor Subscriptions, Foxit PDF Reader, and Foxit Workspace.\":\"Foxit AI Assistant is currently an add-on feature available for use within Foxit PDF Editor Subscriptions, Foxit PDF Reader, and Foxit Workspace.\",\"Foxit AI is currently an add-on available for use within Foxit Editor subscriptions, Foxit Reader, and Foxit Workspace.\":\"Foxit AI is currently an add-on available for use within Foxit Editor subscriptions, Foxit Reader, and Foxit Workspace.\",\"Credits reset monthly based on the subscription cycle.\":\"Credits reset monthly based on the subscription cycle.\",\"Subscription credits (free and paid) reset monthly based on the subscription cycle. Extra Credit Pack credits do not reset and roll over month to month.\":\"Subscription credits (free and paid) reset monthly based on the subscription cycle. Extra Credit Pack credits do not reset and roll over month to month.\",\"Credit pooling is available for enterprise customers via the Admin Console.\":\"Credit pooling is available for enterprise customers via the Admin Console.\",\"If all credits are depleted, AI-powered features within the AI Assistant tab or within the Foxit Workspace platform will be unavailable until the next reset.\":\"If all credits are depleted, AI-powered features within the AI Assistant tab or within the Foxit Workspace platform will be unavailable until the next reset.\",\"If all credits are depleted, AI-powered features within the AI Assistant tab or within Foxit Workspace will be unavailable until the next reset, unless the user has Extra Credit Pack credits available.\":\"If all credits are depleted, AI-powered features within the AI Assistant tab or within Foxit Workspace will be unavailable until the next reset, unless the user has Extra Credit Pack credits available.\",\"Credit usage policies are subject to change based on feature updates and enhancements.\":\"Credit usage policies are subject to change based on feature updates and enhancements.\",\"For further details or support, please visit Foxit Support.\":\"For further details or support, please visit \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit Support\u003c/highlighted\u003e.\",\"*********************ai/credits-usage-policy/*********************end\":\"\",\"Enhance Your Workflow with Foxit Integrations\":\"Enhance Your Workflow with\u003cbr/\u003e\u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit Integrations\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Transform your Google Drive into the perfect starting point for secure eSignature workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors. Effortlessly pull contracts, agreements, or forms from Drive, send them for digital signatures within Foxit eSign, and automatically sync completed files back to their original folders—all without leaving the tools you already know. Manage everything on Foxit eSign’s powerful cloud platform, ensuring your workflows stay smooth, organized, and compliant.\":\"Transform your Google Drive into the perfect starting point for secure eSignature workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors. Effortlessly pull contracts, agreements, or forms from Drive, send them for digital signatures within Foxit eSign, and automatically sync completed files back to their original folders—all without leaving the tools you already know. Manage everything on Foxit eSign’s powerful cloud platform, ensuring your workflows stay smooth, organized, and compliant.\",\"Simplify your HR and payroll operations with the Foxit eSign Connector for ADP Workforce Now. Prepare, send, and track employee agreements or payroll forms using Foxit eSign’s electronic signature app, ensuring every document is signed securely and automatically synced back to ADP Workforce Now for streamlined recordkeeping and compliance.\":\"Simplify your HR and payroll operations with the Foxit eSign Connector for ADP Workforce Now. Prepare, send, and track employee agreements or payroll forms using Foxit eSign’s electronic signature app, ensuring every document is signed securely and automatically synced back to ADP Workforce Now for streamlined recordkeeping and compliance.\",\"Optimize recruiting with Foxit eSign Connectors for Avature. Easily send offer letters, candidate agreements, and compliance forms for electronic contract signing, then sync signed documents back into Avature for smooth hiring workflows. Keep recruitment processes fast, organized, and professional.\":\"Optimize recruiting with Foxit eSign Connectors for Avature. Easily send offer letters, candidate agreements, and compliance forms for electronic contract signing, then sync signed documents back into Avature for smooth hiring workflows. Keep recruitment processes fast, organized, and professional.\",\"Streamline HR workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for BambooHR. Effortlessly send offer letters, onboarding documents, and compliance forms using electronic signature forms, and let completed files sync back automatically. With this connector, you eliminate manual steps and focus on creating a seamless employee experience.\":\"Streamline HR workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for BambooHR. Effortlessly send offer letters, onboarding documents, and compliance forms using electronic signature forms, and let completed files sync back automatically. With this connector, you eliminate manual steps and focus on creating a seamless employee experience.\",\"Make Box the center of your document signing workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors. Pull contracts, agreements, or other critical documents directly from Box into Foxit eSign to prepare, send, and manage electronic contract signing. Completed files are synced back to Box automatically, helping your team stay organized, efficient, and focused on what matters most.\":\"Make Box the center of your document signing workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors. Pull contracts, agreements, or other critical documents directly from Box into Foxit eSign to prepare, send, and manage electronic contract signing. Completed files are synced back to Box automatically, helping your team stay organized, efficient, and focused on what matters most.\",\"Simplify hiring workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for Breezy HR. Send offer letters, candidate agreements, and onboarding documents for online contract signing, and automatically sync signed files back into Breezy HR. This Connector keeps your recruitment process fast, professional, and compliant.\":\"Simplify hiring workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for Breezy HR. Send offer letters, candidate agreements, and onboarding documents for online contract signing, and automatically sync signed files back into Breezy HR. This Connector keeps your recruitment process fast, professional, and compliant.\",\"Empower your staffing and recruiting workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for Bullhorn. Prepare client contracts, candidate agreements, and compliance forms for contract lifecycle management, ensurin