aperless************************start\":\"\",\"Paperless Office Solutions \u0026 Software to Streamline Your Business\":\"Paperless Office Solutions \u0026 Software to Streamline Your Business\",\"Convert paper into digital documents.\":\"Convert paper into digital documents.\",\"If you have large amounts of paper stored in file cabinets or receive a lot of paper mail and faxes, you'll need a high-performance scanner and server software to quickly convert them into digital documents.\":\"If you have large amounts of paper stored in file cabinets or receive a lot of paper mail and faxes, you'll need a high-performance scanner and server software to quickly convert them into digital documents.\",\"Choose an Electronic Signing Solution.\":\"Choose an Electronic Signing Solution.\",\"Organizations have contracts to sign and documents/forms to approve, both internal and external to the company. Foxit PDF Editor+ integration with Foxit eSign, an easy to use eSign solution, makes document signing in paperless offices a breeze.\":\"Organizations have contracts to sign and documents/forms to approve, both internal and external to the company. Foxit PDF Editor+ integration with Foxit eSign, an easy to use eSign solution, makes document signing in paperless offices a breeze.\",\"Digitalize Document Workflows in Your Applications.\":\"Digitalize Document Workflows in Your Applications.\",\"Incorporate PDF technology into your applications with the Foxit PDF SDK. Cross-platform viewing functionality and annotations enable you to highlight and underline text, add comments, strike out text, and even draw shapes over certain parts of a PDF document, all without any printing, from any device.\":\"Incorporate PDF technology into your applications with the Foxit PDF SDK. Cross-platform viewing functionality and annotations enable you to highlight and underline text, add comments, strike out text, and even draw shapes over certain parts of a PDF document, all without any printing, from any device.\",\"Replace paper forms with interactive PDF forms.\":\"Replace paper forms with interactive PDF forms.\",\"Using interactive PDF forms is not only easy to fill out, but you can save the completed digital form for your records and pull the data out of the forms and into a centralized repository. Foxit PDF Editor’s Designer Assistant makes creating interactive PDF forms quick and easy.\":\"Using interactive PDF forms is not only easy to fill out, but you can save the completed digital form for your records and pull the data out of the forms and into a centralized repository. Foxit PDF Editor’s Designer Assistant makes creating interactive PDF forms quick and easy.\",\"Standardize on a PDF Editor to Build, Modify, and Manage Documents.\":\"Standardize on a PDF Editor to Build, Modify, and Manage Documents.\",\"PDF is the file format of choice for managing a paperless office. Foxit PDF Editor provides the industry’s best solution for building and modifying your shareable PDF documents. Its built-in integration with Enterprise Content Management (ECM) systems makes management and collaboration easy.\":\"PDF is the file format of choice for managing a paperless office. \u003cLinkto\u003eFoxit PDF Editor\u003c/Linkto\u003e provides the industry’s best solution for building and modifying your shareable PDF documents. Its built-in integration with Enterprise Content Management (ECM) systems makes management and collaboration easy.\",\"Go Fully Paperless. Stay Fully Productive.\":\"Go Fully \u003chighlighted\u003ePaperless.\u003c/highlighted\u003e \u003cbr/\u003eStay Fully \u003chighlighted\u003eProductive.\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"*********************HowToGoPaperless************************end\":\"\",\"Both\":\"Both\",\"Subscribe to our newsletter for pro tips and exciting tech \u0026 trend news, or to our update bulletins for new release announcements, security \u0026 service updates, and status changes.\":\"Subscribe to our newsletter for pro tips and exc