tem emails, and notifications.\",\"Integrate with 40+ HR, CRM, storage, and productivity platforms to sync data, trigger workflows, and eliminate redundant app switching.\":\"Integrate with 40+ HR, CRM, storage, and productivity platforms to sync data, trigger workflows, and eliminate redundant app switching.\",\"Prepare and send eSign-ready documents without leaving Foxit PDF Editor. Full template and form field support included.\":\"Prepare and send eSign-ready documents without leaving Foxit PDF Editor. Full template and form field support included.\",\"Enable real-time document collaboration in Microsoft Teams. Supports shared editing, commenting, and live signature workflows.\":\"Enable real-time document collaboration in Microsoft Teams. Supports shared editing, commenting, and live signature workflows.\",\"Send, sign, and track documents directly in Dynamics. Manage records and agreements in a single platform.\":\"Send, sign, and track documents directly in Dynamics. Manage records and agreements in a single platform.\",\"Accept signed submissions via WordPress forms. Automate delivery and routing of submitted documents.\":\"Accept signed submissions via WordPress forms. Automate delivery and routing of submitted documents.\",\"Use Zapier to connect Foxit eSign to 5,000+ apps. Automate actions and integrate without writing code.\":\"Use Zapier to connect Foxit eSign to 5,000+ apps. Automate actions and integrate without writing code.\",\"Upload Integrations\":\"Upload Integrations\",\"Import and export documents between Foxit eSign and OneDrive, Google Drive, Dropbox, or Box. Send for signature and sync completed copies back to your storage.\":\"Import and export documents between Foxit eSign and OneDrive, Google Drive, Dropbox, or Box. Send for signature and sync completed copies back to your storage.\",\"Embed legally compliant eSignature workflows into your app. Send, sign, and track documents with full audit trails and flexible identity controls.\":\"Embed legally compliant eSignature workflows into your app. Send, sign, and track documents with full audit trails and flexible identity controls.\",\"Automate PDF creation, conversion, and manipulation. Generate, merge, split, and flatten PDFs from any system with scalable REST endpoints.\":\"Automate PDF creation, conversion, and manipulation. Generate, merge, split, and flatten PDFs from any system with scalable REST endpoints.\",\"Create dynamic PDFs from DOCX or HTML templates using API-driven data. Automate personalized documents at scale with full layout control and no manual formatting.\":\"Create dynamic PDFs from DOCX or HTML templates using API-driven data. Automate personalized documents at scale with full layout control and no manual formatting.\",\"Display interactive PDFs in your app or website with no plugins. Supports annotations, form fills, and responsive UX across devices.\":\"Display interactive PDFs in your app or website with no plugins. Supports annotations, form fills, and responsive UX across devices.\",\"Centralize access to shareable templates and forms. Ensure consistency and speed across your team.\":\"Centralize access to shareable templates and forms. Ensure consistency and speed across your team.\",\"Control signer routing using defined workflows. Automatically move documents through each step.\":\"Control signer routing using defined workflows. Automatically move documents through each step.\",\"Send recipient-specific language templates. Streamlines multi-language delivery and response.\":\"Send recipient-specific language templates. Streamlines multi-language delivery and response.\",\"Add smart form fields to capture structured data and attachments. Configure field logic and validation.\":\"Add smart form fields to capture structured data and attachments. Configure field logic and validation.\",\"Deliver secure signing links via email, SMS, or in-app. No account creation or downloads required.\":\"Deliver secure signing links via ema