s Forward\":\"Built for the Teams That Move Agreements Forward\",\"Built for the agreements your business depends on.\":\"Built for the agreements your business depends on.\",\"Built into the lifecycle\":\"Built into the lifecycle\",\"Built-in eSignature\":\"Built-in eSignature\",\"Built-in eSignature and document management\":\"Built-in eSignature and document management\",\"CLM\":\"CLM\",\"Capability\":\"Capability\",\"Capture tamper-evident audit information\":\"Capture tamper-evident audit information\",\"Capture timestamps, signer details, and agreement activity\":\"Capture timestamps, signer details, and agreement activity\",\"Centralize access, retention, audit history, and reporting while keeping everyday contract work simple for business users.\":\"Centralize access, retention, audit history, and reporting while keeping everyday contract work simple for business users.\",\"Centralize records across properties and projects\":\"Centralize records across properties and projects\",\"Centralize vendor contracts, standardize approvals, and surface renewal dates before unfavorable terms roll forward.\":\"Centralize vendor contracts, standardize approvals, and surface renewal dates before unfavorable terms roll forward.\",\"Collaborate with internal and external reviewers\":\"Collaborate with internal and external reviewers\",\"Collect signatures without exporting files\":\"Collect signatures without exporting files\",\"Configure sequential or parallel approvals, notify reviewers, and track each decision from one workspace.\":\"Configure sequential or parallel approvals, notify reviewers, and track each decision from one workspace.\",\"Connected work from first draft through renewal\":\"Connected work from first draft through renewal\",\"Contract problems build when drafting, review, signing, and follow-up happen in separate places. Foxit Agreements replaces that patchwork with one connected platform that brings structure, visibility, and control to the entire lifecycle.\":\"Contract problems build when drafting, review, signing, and follow-up happen in separate places. Foxit Agreements replaces that patchwork with one connected platform that brings structure, visibility, and control to the entire lifecycle.\",\"Contract-specific tracking\":\"Contract-specific tracking\",\"Control Built In\":\"Control Built In\",\"Control access to sensitive agreement information\":\"Control access to sensitive agreement information\",\"Control after signature.\":\"Control after signature.\",\"Control supplier agreements before they slow production.\":\"Control supplier agreements before they slow production.\",\"Control supplier agreements from intake through renewal.\":\"Control supplier agreements from intake through renewal.\",\"Convert scanned contracts into searchable text\":\"Convert scanned contracts into searchable text\",\"Coordinate sourcing, legal, and finance approvals\":\"Coordinate sourcing, legal, and finance approvals\",\"Create \u0026 Draft\":\"Create \u0026 Draft\",\"Create engagement letters from approved templates\":\"Create engagement letters from approved templates\",\"Create templates for common agreement types\":\"Create templates for common agreement types\",\"Customers\":\"Customers\",\"Draft\":\"Draft\",\"Draft and revise in the browser, convert scanned contracts with OCR, and preserve every revision.\":\"Draft and revise in the browser, convert scanned contracts with OCR, and preserve every revision.\",\"Draft, negotiate, approve, sign, store, and track agreements without rebuilding the process across separate vendors.\":\"Draft, negotiate, approve, sign, store, and track agreements without rebuilding the process across separate vendors.\",\"Drafting \u0026 Editing\":\"Drafting \u0026 Editing\",\"Drafting and templates\":\"Drafting and templates\",\"Each stage stays connected, so context, ownership, and history move with the agreement. Everyone permitted can see what has happened, what comes next, and who needs to act.\":\"Each stage stays connected, so context, ownership, and history move with the agreement. Everyone permitted can see what has happened, what comes next, and who needs to act.\",\"Earlier risk visibility.\":\"Earlier risk visibility.\",\"Edit agreements in a browser-based workspace\":\"Edit agreements in a browser-based workspace\",\"Edit where the agreement already lives.\":\"Edit where the agreement already lives.\",\"Edits scatter across inboxes and drives.\":\"Edits scatter across inboxes and drives.\",\"Employees\":\"Employees\",\"Encrypt document data at rest and in transit\":\"Encrypt document data at rest and in transit\",\"Envelope Tracking\":\"Envelope Tracking\",\"Every agreement starts over.\":\"Every agreement starts over.\",\"Every industry has its own agreement types, review standards, and critical dates. Foxit Agreements provides a flexible foundation you can shape around those requirements.\":\"Every industry has its own agreement types, review standards, and critical dates. Foxit Agreements provides a flexible foundation you can shape around those requirements.\",\"Execute\":\"Execute\",\"Execution\":\"Execution\",\"Export activity and compliance-ready reports\":\"Export activity and compliance-ready reports\",\"Financial Services \u0026 Insurance\":\"Financial Services \u0026 Insurance\",\"Five contract problems. \u003cmuted\u003eOne practical fix.\u003c/muted\u003e\":\"Five contract problems. \u003cmuted\u003eOne practical fix.\u003c/muted\u003e\",\"Flag risky or non-standard language\":\"Flag risky or non-standard language\",\"Focus reviewer attention on important terms\":\"Focus reviewer attention on important terms\",\"Follow Through\":\"Follow Through\",\"Foxit Agreements FAQ\":\"Foxit Agreements FAQ\",\"Foxit Agreements contract lifecycle dashboard\":\"Foxit Agreements contract lifecycle dashboard\",\"Foxit Agreements includes core CLM capabilities, built-in eSignature for legally binding signing workflows, and integrated Foxit DMS storage with unlimited pooled cloud storage. Foxit Agreements also provides unlimited agreements, workflows, and templates, plus browser-based editing through Microsoft Office Online; advanced PDF work requires a separate \u003ceditor\u003eFoxit PDF Editor\u003c/editor\u003e license.\":\"Foxit Agreements includes core CLM capabilities, built-in eSignature for legally binding signing workflows, and integrated Foxit DMS storage with unlimited pooled cloud storage. Foxit Agreements also provides unlimited agreements, workflows, and templates, plus browser-based editing through Microsoft Office Online; advanced PDF work requires a separate \u003ceditor\u003eFoxit PDF Editor\u003c/editor\u003e license.\",\"Foxit Agreements includes secure, legally binding eSignature, so execution stays connected to the lifecycle.\":\"Foxit Agreements includes secure, legally binding eSignature, so execution stays connected to the lifecycle.\",\"Foxit Agreements is a \u003cclm\u003econtract lifecycle management (CLM)\u003c/clm\u003e platform that connects drafting, negotiation, approvals, built-in eSignature, document storage, renewals, and obligation tracking in one governed workspace. Foxit Agreements keeps agreement status, ownership, history, and post-signature actions connected from the first request through renewal.\":\"Foxit Agreements is a \u003cclm\u003econtract lifecycle management (CLM)\u003c/clm\u003e platform that connects drafting, negotiation, approvals, built-in eSignature, document storage, renewals, and obligation tracking in one governed workspace. Foxit Agreements keeps agreement status, ownership, history, and post-signature actions connected from the first request through renewal.\",\"Foxit Agreements is built on the same secure document ecosystem organizations already use for business-critical work. That shared foundation reduces tool switching, keeps records consistent, and gives IT clearer control.\":\"Foxit Agreements is built on the same secure document ecosystem organizations already use for business-critical work. That shared foundation reduces tool switching, keeps records consistent, and gives IT clearer control.\",\"Foxit Agreements manages the full contract lifecycle, while standalone \u003cesign\u003eeSignature tools\u003c/esign\u003e primarily focus on sending and signing and basic \u003cstorage\u003edocument storage\u003c/storage\u003e focuses on organizing files. Foxit Agreements brings templates, clause management, negotiation, approvals, built-in eSignature, governance, renewals, obligations, and reporting into one connected process.\":\"Foxit Agreements manages the full contract lifecycle, while standalone \u003cesign\u003eeSignature tools\u003c/esign\u003e primarily focus on sending and signing and basic \u003cstorage\u003edocument storage\u003c/storage\u003e focuses on organizing files. Foxit Agreements brings templates, clause management, negotiation, approvals, built-in eSignature, governance, renewals, obligations, and reporting into one connected process.\",\"Foxit Agreements protects contract workflows with role-based access controls, encryption, tamper-evident signing records, audit trails, authentication controls, and retention policies. Foxit Agreements supports governed handling across the agreement lifecycle, while Foxit ecosystem security and compliance resources address standards and requirements including SOC 2, HIPAA, GDPR, CCPA, FINRA, and eIDAS. Review the \u003ctrust\u003eFoxit Trust Center\u003c/trust\u003e for current security and compliance information.\":\"Foxit Agreements protects contract workflows with role-based access controls, encryption, tamper-evident signing records, audit trails, authentication controls, and retention policies. Foxit Agreements supports governed handling across the agreement lifecycle, while Foxit ecosystem security and compliance resources address standards and requirements including SOC 2, HIPAA, GDPR, CCPA, FINRA, and eIDAS. Review the \u003ctrust\u003eFoxit Trust Center\u003c/trust\u003e for current security and compliance information.\",\"Foxit Agreements tracks expiration dates, notice periods, review dates, milestones, and contractual obligations after signature. Foxit Agreements uses reminders, ownership fields, renewal and expiry views, and reporting to surface upcoming actions before deadlines pass, helping teams replace spreadsheets, inbox follow-ups, and memory-based \u003ccm\u003econtract management\u003c/cm\u003e.\":\"Foxit Agreements tracks expiration dates, notice periods, review dates, milestones, and contractual obligations after signature. Foxit Agreements uses reminders, ownership fields, renewal and expiry views, and reporting to surface upcoming actions before deadlines pass, helping teams replace spreadsheets, inbox follow-ups, and memory-based \u003ccm\u003econtract management\u003c/cm\u003e.\",\"Foxit DMS provides unlimited pooled storage with metadata, OCR search, permissions, and version history.\":\"Foxit DMS provides unlimited pooled storage with metadata, OCR search, permissions, and version history.\",\"Foxit's document platform is trusted by more than 700 million users worldwide and has earned G2 recognition for value, momentum, administration, and support.\":\"Foxit's document platform is trusted by more than 700 million users worldwide and has earned G2 recognition for value, momentum, administration, and support.\",\"Free Trial includes 5 agreements over 90 days. No credit card required.\":\"Free Trial includes 5 agreements over 90 days. No credit card required.\",\"Free trial includes 5 agreements over 90 days. No credit card required.\":\"Free trial includes 5 agreements over 90 days. No credit card required.\",\"Free trial: 5 agreements over 90 days. No credit card required.\":\"Free trial: 5 agreements over 90 days. No credit card required.\",\"From Fragmented to Controlled\":\"From Fragmented to Controlled\",\"G2 Best Estimated ROI\":\"G2 Best Estimated ROI\",\"G2 Best Software Top 50