ring secure and efficient document management for businesses.\":\"Edit PDFs easily using Foxit free online PDF editor. Add text, comments, highlight, annotate, fill \u0026 sign forms, insert images, and more in seconds.\",\"Podcast | Foxit\":\"Podcast | Foxit\",\"The Podcast on All Things PDF. Interviews and discussions with PDF subject matter experts. Industry Case Studies, Document Security, User Stories, ISO Standards, PDF features.\":\"The Podcast on All Things PDF. Interviews and discussions with PDF subject matter experts. Industry Case Studies, Document Security, User Stories, ISO Standards, PDF features.\",\"Foxit Volume Licensing: Bulk PDF Editor \u0026 eSign Savings | Foxit\":\"Foxit Volume Licensing: Bulk PDF Editor \u0026 eSign Savings | Foxit\",\"Unlock enterprise savings with Foxit volume licensing for PDF Editor and eSign. Benefit from bulk pricing discounts, centralized license management, and scalable deployment. Get your quote today!\":\"Unlock enterprise savings with Foxit volume licensing for PDF Editor and eSign. Benefit from bulk pricing discounts, centralized license management, and scalable deployment. Get your quote today!\",\"Resource Hub | Foxit\":\"Resource Hub | Foxit\",\"Download Complete – PDF Editor | Foxit\":\"Download Complete – PDF Editor | Foxit\",\"Your download is ready. Start editing, converting, and managing PDFs with Foxit PDF Editor.\":\"Your download is ready. Start editing, converting, and managing PDFs with Foxit PDF Editor.\",\"G2 Special Offer: Foxit PDF Editor Discount \u0026 Promo Deals | Foxit\":\"G2 Special Offer: Foxit PDF Editor Discount \u0026 Promo Deals | Foxit\",\"Save big on Foxit PDF Editor with our exclusive G2 special offer. Get limited-time discounts, promo codes, and premium features for seamless PDF editing.\":\"Save big on Foxit PDF Editor with our exclusive G2 special offer. Get limited-time discounts, promo codes, and premium features for seamless PDF editing.\",\"IDC Analyst Brief: The Power of AI | Foxit\":\"IDC Analyst Brief: The Power of AI | Foxit\",\"Discover how AI transforms document workflows, boosting productivity and collaboration across enterprises.\":\"Discover how AI transforms document workflows, boosting productivity and collaboration across enterprises.\",\"Quick PDF Library Software License Agreement | Foxit\":\"Quick PDF Library Software License Agreement | Foxit\",\"Review the Quick PDF Library Software License Agreement, including licensing terms, usage rights, restrictions, warranties, support provisions, and liability limitations.\":\"Review the Quick PDF Library Software License Agreement, including licensing terms, usage rights, restrictions, warranties, support provisions, and liability limitations.\",\"Escape from Adobe — Displace Acrobat, Earn 10% Margin | Foxit\":\"Escape from Adobe — Displace Acrobat, Earn 10% Margin | Foxit\",\"Exclusive Foxit reseller promotion: move your client off Adobe Acrobat for up to 60% off, stack partner incentives to 10% margin, and lock deal protection. Registration closes December 15, 2026.\":\"Exclusive Foxit reseller promotion: move your client off Adobe Acrobat for up to 60% off, stack partner incentives to 10% margin, and lock deal protection. Registration closes December 15, 2026.\",\"Bank Document Management \u0026 Automation Software | Foxit\":\"Bank Document Management \u0026 Automation Software | Foxit\",\"Prepare lending documents, collect signatures, manage vendor agreements, and automate records processing with Foxit PDF Editor+, eSign, and Agreements.\":\"Prepare lending documents, collect signatures, manage vendor agreements, and automate records processing with Foxit PDF Editor+, eSign, and Agreements.\",\"Government Document Management Software | Foxit\":\"Government Document Management Software | Foxit\",\"Review public records, publish accessible forms, redact sensitive information, digitize paper backlogs, and collect signatures with Foxit.\":\"Review public records, publish accessible forms, redact sensitive information, digitize paper backlogs, and collect signatures with Foxit.\",\"Healthcare PDF and eSignature Software | Foxit\":\"Healthcare PDF and eSignature Software | Foxit\",\"Prepare scanned healthcare PDFs, collect appropriate eSignatures, redact sensitive information, and scale document processing with Foxit.\":\"Prepare scanned healthcare PDFs, collect appropriate eSignatures, redact sensitive information, and scale document processing with Foxit.\",\"Insurance Document Management Software | Foxit\":\"Insurance Document Management Software | Foxit\",\"Prepare policy documents, collect signatures, review claim files, protect sensitive information, and automate high-volume insurance records processing.\":\"Prepare policy documents, collect signatures, review claim files, protect sensitive information, and automate high-volume insurance records processing.\",\"Legal Document Management Software for Law Firms | Foxit\":\"Legal Document Management Software for Law Firms | Foxit\",\"Prepare case files, redact sensitive information, collect signatures, and manage contract obligations with Foxit software for law firms and legal teams.\":\"Prepare case files, redact sensitive information, collect signatures, and manage contract obligations with Foxit software for law firms and legal teams.\",\"Manufacturing Document Management Software | Foxit\":\"Manufacturing Document Management Software | Foxit\",\"Keep specifications, work instructions, quality records, and supplier agreements accurate with Foxit PDF Editor+, Agreements, and Enterprise Automation.\":\"Keep specifications, work instructions, quality records, and supplier agreements accurate with Foxit PDF Editor+, Agreements, and Enterprise Automation.\",\"Construction Document Management Software | Foxit\":\"Construction Document Management Software | Foxit\",\"Mark up drawing sets with custom symbols, keep revision page labels in order, and measure from the sheet with Foxit PDF Editor+ on Windows.\":\"Mark up drawing sets with custom symbols, keep revision page labels in order, and measure from the sheet with Foxit PDF Editor+ on Windows.\",\"PDF Editor for Students \u0026 Universities | Foxit\":\"PDF Editor for Students \u0026 Universities | Foxit\",\"Get Foxit PDF Editor+ for Education at $49.99/year: full PDF editing, eSign, and AI tools for eligible students, faculty, and staff.\":\"Get Foxit PDF Editor+ for Education at $49.99/year: full PDF editing, eSign, and AI tools for eligible students, faculty, and staff.\",\"PDF and eSign Discounts for Nonprofits | Foxit\":\"PDF and eSign Discounts for Nonprofits | Foxit\",\"Eligible nonprofits, charities, and libraries can save up to 68% on Foxit PDF editing, eSign, and document tools through TechSoup.\":\"Eligible nonprofits, charities, and libraries can save up to 68% on Foxit PDF editing, eSign, and document tools through TechSoup.\",\"*********************  meta  ************************end\":\"\",\"Start 90-Day Free Trial\":\"Start 90-Day Free Trial\",\"\u003cnewLabel\u003eNew:\u003c/newLabel\u003e Contracts stuck in email and spreadsheets? Meet Foxit Agreements. \u003cctaLink\u003eLearn More\u003c/ctaLink\u003e\":\"\u003cnewLabel\u003eNew:\u003c/newLabel\u003e Contracts stuck in email and spreadsheets? Meet Foxit Agreements. \u003cctaLink\u003eLearn More\u003c/ctaLink\u003e\",\"\u003cstrongtext\u003eFoxit Agreements\u003c/strongtext\u003e keeps contract work connected, visible, and easier to manage.\":\"\u003cstrongtext\u003eFoxit Agreements\u003c/strongtext\u003e keeps contract work connected, visible, and easier to manage.\",\"\u003cstrongtext\u003eFoxit Agreements\u003c/strongtext\u003e keeps every contract, decision, and deadline connected so teams can move with more clarity and control.\":\"\u003cstrongtext\u003eFoxit Agreements\u003c/strongtext\u003e keeps every contract, decision, and deadline connected so teams can move with more clarity and control.\",\"Foxit Agreements connects negotiation, approvals, and renewals.\":\"Foxit Agreements connects negotiation, approvals, and renewals.\",\"Keep Contracts Moving\":\"Keep Contracts Moving\",\"Manage Agreements From Draft to Renewal\":\"Manage Agreements From Draft to Renewal\",\"Take control of every agreement.\":\"Take control of every agreement.\",\"Copied successfully.\":\"Copied successfully.\",\"Copy failed\":\"Copy failed\",\"******************** header-menu/nav ********************start\":\"\",\"Volume Licensing\":\"Volume Licensing\",\"Buy Now\":\"Buy Now\",\"Products\":\"Products\",\"Developers\":\"Developers\",\"Solutions\":\"Solutions\",\"Free PDF Tools\":\"Free PDF Tools\",\"Resources\":\"Resources\",\"Partners\":\"Partners\",\"******************** header-menu/nav ********************end\":\"\",\"******************** header-menu/products ********************start\":\"\",\"Foxit PDF Editor\":\"Foxit PDF Editor\",\"The #1 alternative to Adobe Acrobat for creating, editing, converting, signing, and securely managing PDFs across desktop, mobile, and web browsers.\":\"The #1 alternative to Adobe Acrobat for creating, editing, converting, signing, and securely managing PDFs across desktop, mobile, and web browsers.\",\"Desktop · Web\":\"Desktop · Web\",\"Plans \u0026 Pricing\":\"Plans \u0026 Pricing\",\"Start free trial\":\"Start free trial\",\"Workspace\":\"Workspace\",\"Workspace turns source documents into reports, slides, and diagrams — ready to edit, not just read.\":\"Workspace turns source documents into reports, slides, and diagrams — ready to edit, not just read.\",\"Organize, analyze, and act on your documents in one AI-powered workspace built to turn scattered information into clear insights and faster action.\":\"Organize, analyze, and act on your documents in one AI-powered workspace built to turn scattered information into clear insights and faster action.\",\"New · AI\":\"New · AI\",\"Download the free app\":\"Download the free app\",\"Foxit Agreements\":\"Foxit Agreements\",\"Create, negotiate, and manage agreements in one workflow while tracking obligations, renewals, compliance, and key details from draft to signature.\":\"Create, negotiate, and manage agreements in one workflow while tracking obligations, renewals, compliance, and key details from draft to signature.\",\"Cloud\":\"Cloud\",\"Foxit eSign\":\"Foxit eSign\",\"Send, sign, and manage agreements through secure eSignature workflows.\":\"Send, sign, and manage agreements through secure eSignature workflows.\",\"Foxit PDF Reader\":\"Foxit PDF Reader\",\"Read, annotate, and collaborate on PDFs with a fast, free PDF reader.\":\"Read, annotate, and collaborate on PDFs with a fast, free PDF reader.\",\"Free\":\"Free\",\"Summarize, translate, search, and chat with PDFs for faster answers.\":\"Summarize, translate, search, and chat with PDFs for faster answers.\",\"Find and permanently remove sensitive information with AI redaction.\":\"Find and permanently remove sensitive information with AI redaction.\",\"Maestro Server OCR\":\"Maestro Server OCR\",\"Turn scanned archives into searchable documents.\":\"Turn scanned archives into searchable documents.\",\"Turn Documents Into Deliverables\":\"Turn Documents Into Deliverables\",\"PDF Compressor\":\"PDF Compressor\",\"Reduce file size without sacrificing quality.\":\"Reduce file size without sacrificing quality.\",\"Rendition Server\":\"Rendition Server\",\"Convert business files into standardized PDFs.\":\"Convert business files into standardized PDFs.\",\"Smart Redact Server\":\"Smart Redact Server\",\"Batch-redact sensitive data across your systems.\":\"Batch-redact sensitive data across your systems.\",\"Featured Products\":\"Featured Products\",\"Document Productivity\":\"Document Productivity\",\"Document Intelligence\":\"Document Intelligence\",\"Enterprise Automation\":\"Enterprise Automation\",\"Compare\":\"Compare\",\"Admin Console\":\"Admin Console\",\"Explore All Products\":\"Explore All Products\",\"Download Foxit PDF Editor