f the ordered products will be completed.\",\"You'll be redirected to the banking site to complete your payment.\":\"You'll be redirected to the banking site to complete your payment.\",\"This site is protected by Google reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply.\":\"This site is protected by Google reCAPTCHA and the \u003cpolicyLink\u003eGoogle Privacy Policy\u003c/policyLink\u003e and \u003ctermsLink\u003eTerms of Service\u003c/termsLink\u003e apply.\",\"You already have a {value}. Please click here to manage your subscription.\":\"You already have a {{value}}. Please click \u003chighlighted\u003ehere\u003c/highlighted\u003e to manage your subscription.\",\"You have an eSign Business subscription. To make changes, such as adding more subscriptions, please go to My Orders to manage your subscription.\":\"You have an eSign Business subscription. To make changes, such as adding more subscriptions, please go to My Orders to manage your subscription.\",\"CLOSE\":\"CLOSE\",\"Verification Code\":\"Verification Code\",\"Although you are already signed into a Foxit Account, you need to provide additional information for your trial. Please fill in the registration form and submit.\":\"Although you are already signed into a Foxit Account, you need to provide additional information for your trial. Please fill in the registration form and submit.\",\"Although you are already signed into a Foxit Account, you need to provide additional information for your trial. Please fill in the registration form and click Submit.\":\"Although you are already signed into a Foxit Account, you need to provide additional information for your trial. Please fill in the registration form and click Submit.\",\"City (Optional)\":\"City (Optional)\",\"Optional\":\"(Optional)\",\"Company Name\":\"Company Name\",\"item\":\"item\",\"Total Amount:\":\"Total Amount:\",\"Tax:\":\"Tax:\",\"I agree with the Privacy Policy and Terms of use.\":\"I agree with the Privacy Policy and Terms of use.\",\"The email address is already in use. Please Log in to your Foxit account.\":\"The email address is already in use. Please Log in to your Foxit account.\",\"email must be a valid email\":\"email must be a valid email\",\"The domain names @ust.hk and @connect.ust.hk are currently reserved for the use of “The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (HKUST)” only. For personal subscriptions, please use a different email address.\":\"The domain names @ust.hk and @connect.ust.hk are currently reserved for the use of “The Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (HKUST)” only. For personal subscriptions, please use a different email address.\",\"Please enter cardholder's name\":\"Please enter cardholder's name\",\"PDF Editor+ for Education is for education users only. Purchasers must have an education email account.\":\"PDF Editor+ for Education is for education users only. Purchasers must have an education email account.\",\"Your email address is not eligible for purchase\":\"Your email address is not eligible for purchase\",\"This coupon code is not valid for the item being purchased.\":\"This coupon code is not valid for the item being purchased.\",\"email does not exist\":\"email does not exist\",\"Please input a valid email address.\":\"Please input a valid email address.\",\"Just One More Step\":\"Just \u003chighlighted\u003eOne\u003c/highlighted\u003e More Step\",\"Sign up for a free Foxit account. No credit card needed.\":\"Sign up for a \u003chighlighted\u003efree Foxit account\u003c/highlighted\u003e. No credit card needed.\",\"Login with Foxit Account\":\"Login with Foxit Account\",\"Or\":\"Or\",\"No account?\":\"No account?\",\"your free account lets you:\":\"your free account lets you:\",\"Annotation, notes and comments\":\"Annotation, notes and comments\",\"Highlight, shapes, and drawing\":\"Highlight, shapes, and drawing\",\"Centralized file organization in the Document Management System (DMS)\":\"Centralized file organization in the Document Management System (DMS)\",\"The file size exceeds the upload limit of 10MB.\":\"The file size exceeds the upload limit of 10MB.\",\"Edit or convert a PDF\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eEdit or convert\u003c/highlighted\u003e a PDF\",\"Uploading 291.6 MB file...\":\"Uploading {{value}} MB file...\",\"Cancel\":\"Cancel\",\"License-Based Access (Not Ownership)\":\"License-Based Access (Not Ownership)\",\"To continue, click “Agree \u0026 Continue” to accept the EULA, the Terms of Service, and acknowledge the Privacy Policy.\":\"To continue, click “Agree \u0026 Continue” to accept the \u003ceulaLink\u003eEULA\u003c/eulaLink\u003e, the \u003ctermsLink\u003eTerms of Service\u003c/termsLink\u003e, and acknowledge the \u003cpolicyLink\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/policyLink\u003e.\",\"What you are buying is a license to access the digital good, not an unrestricted ownership interest. The license will be delivered electronically in an email, so there will be no physical items shipped to your address. If you do not receive this email, please contact Foxit at your earliest convenience. Please proceed with the purchase after confirmation.\":\"What you are buying is a license to access the digital good, not an unrestricted ownership interest. The license will be delivered electronically in an email, so there will be no physical items shipped to your address. If you do not receive this email, please contact Foxit at your earliest convenience. Please proceed with the purchase after confirmation.\",\"compare banner content\":\"compare banner content\",\"DocuSign\":\"DocuSign\",\"Foxit eSign ranks higher for ease of use, support, and customer satisfaction on G2 Crowd. Boasting unlimited envelopes, no extra fees for HIPPA and CFR compliance and plans starting at 37% less than DocuSign, Foxit delivers exceptional convenience, flexibility and value.\":\"Foxit eSign ranks higher for ease of use, support, and customer satisfaction on G2 Crowd. Boasting unlimited envelopes, no extra fees for HIPPA and CFR compliance and plans starting at 37% less than DocuSign, Foxit delivers exceptional convenience, flexibility and value.\",\"PandaDoc\":\"PandaDoc\",\"COMPANY VIDEOS\":\"COMPANY VIDEOS\",\"WHITEPAPERS\":\"WHITEPAPERS\",\"Foxit eSign White Paper\":\"Foxit eSign White Paper\",\"DATA SHEETS\":\"DATA SHEETS\",\"for quotes and details on our volume discounts.\":\"for quotes and details on our volume discounts.\",\"Foxit eSign Business outperforms DocuSign in several key areas according to G2 ratings. DocuSign’s per-envelope and per-template pricing can be cost prohibitive for growing businesses. Foxit eSign Business is designed to support growing businesses by providing unlimited envelopes and templates at no extra cost. Compliance standards are also included by default, with Foxit eSign Business offering out-of-the-box HIPAA and 21 CFR Part 11 compliance without requiring any enterprise upgrades or add-ons like DocuSign. For businesses needing specialized support, Foxit’s 24/7 notary services are available on demand, alongside enhanced customer branding and bulk signing capabilities - all for a lower cost than DocuSign.\":\"Foxit eSign Business outperforms DocuSign in several key areas according to G2 ratings. DocuSign’s per-envelope and per-template pricing can be cost prohibitive for growing businesses. Foxit eSign Business is designed to support growing businesses by providing unlimited envelopes and templates at no extra cost. Compliance standards are also included by default, with Foxit eSign Business offering out-of-the-box HIPAA and 21 CFR Part 11 compliance without requiring any enterprise upgrades or add-ons like DocuSign. For businesses needing specialized support, Foxit’s 24/7 notary services are available on demand, alongside enhanced customer branding and bulk signing capabilities - all for a lower cost than DocuSign.\",\"FEATURES\":\"FEATURES\",\"PandaDoc vs Foxit eSign Comparison\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003ePandaDoc vs Foxit eSign\u003c/highlighted\u003e Comparison\",\"Foxit eSign is a feature-rich PandaDoc alternative for businesses that want premium eSignature features without the premium price tag.\":\"Foxit eSign is a feature-rich PandaDoc alternative for businesses that want premium eSignature features without the premium price tag.\",\"As a G2 Momentum Leader, Foxit eSign provides robust functionality with industry-leading compliance and security for digital signing workflows. Users looking for premium features like unlimited envelopes, 24/7 notary services, and HIPAA or 21 CFR Part 11 compliance will find that PandaDoc requires paid add-ons, while Foxit eSign offers them at no additional cost. Foxit eSign’s base plan includes seamless integration into Microsoft’s ecosystem, including Teams and SharePoint integrations, whereas PandaDoc’s integration options are sold separately. Foxit eSign meets the needs of growing businesses, making it the smarter choice for companies focused on saving costs without sacrificing quality or functionality.\":\"As a G2 Momentum Leader, Foxit eSign provides robust functionality with industry-leading compliance and security for digital signing workflows. Users looking for premium features like unlimited envelopes, 24/7 notary services, and HIPAA or 21 CFR Part 11 compliance will find that PandaDoc requires paid add-ons, while Foxit eSign offers them at no additional cost. Foxit eSign’s base plan includes seamless integration into Microsoft’s ecosystem, including Teams and SharePoint integrations, whereas PandaDoc’s integration options are sold separately. Foxit eSign meets the needs of growing businesses, making it the smarter choice for companies focused on saving costs without sacrificing quality or functionality.\",\"Great Affordable Alternative to Other Software\":\"Great Affordable Alternative to Other Software\",\"Frequently Asked Questions\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"How does Foxit PDF Editor compare to Adobe Acrobat?\":\"How does Foxit PDF Editor compare to Adobe Acrobat?\",\"Foxit PDF Editor is often chosen as a cost-effective, easy-to-use alternative to Adobe Acrobat. Users love its clean, intuitive layout and features that cover all the basics—and then some—without the Adobe price tag. Many users find Foxit’s customer support more responsive, too, which is always a plus!\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit PDF Editor\u003c/highlighted\u003e is often chosen as a cost-effective, easy-to-use alternative to Adobe Acrobat. Users love its clean, intuitive layout and features that cover all the basics—and then some—without the Adobe price tag. Many users find Foxit’s customer support more responsive, too, which is always a plus!\",\"What platforms are Foxit products available on?\":\"What platforms are Foxit products available on?\",\"Foxit’s PDF software tools are available on Windows, macOS, iOS, and Android, so you can work from just about any device. We even offer a browser-based version, so all you ever need is an internet connection to access your PDFs.\":\"Foxit’s PDF software tools are available on Windows, macOS, iOS, and Android, so you can work from just about any device. We even offer a browser-based version, so all you ever need is an internet connection to access your PDFs.\",\"Is Foxit secure for handling sensitive documents?\":\"Is Foxit secure for handling sensitive documents?\",\"Absolutely! Foxit is committed to keeping your documents safe. We use top-notch security measures like passwords, encryption, and secure deletion to protect your information. You can rest easy knowing your sensitive files are in good hands.\":\"Absolutely! Foxit is committed to keeping your documents safe. We use top-notch security measures like passwords, encryption, and secure deletion to protect your information. You can rest easy knowing your sensitive files are in good hands.\",\" Can I collaborate with others using Foxit PDF solutions?\":\" Can I collaborate with others using Foxit PDF solutions?\",\"Definitely! Foxit’s PDF software makes it super easy to work with your team. You can review, comment, and annotate documents in real time and even get quick digital signatures with Foxit eSign. No more juggling multiple versions or waiting around for approvals.\":\"Definitely! Foxit’s PDF software makes it super easy to work with your team. You can review, comment, and annotate documents in real time and even get quick digital signatures with Foxit eSign. No more juggling multiple versions or waiting around for approvals.\",\"What kind of licensing options does Foxit offer for organizations?\":\"What kind of licensing options does Foxit offer for organizations?\",\"Foxit offers flexible licensing options to fit your organization's specific needs. Whether you're a small team or a large enterprise, Foxit has you covered. You can choose between subscription-based plans or one-time purchases. Plus, we offer volume discounts for larger teams, making it easy to find a cost-effective solution. Explore volume licensing options.\":\"Foxit offers flexible licensing options to fit your organization's specific needs. Whether you're a small team or a large enterprise, Foxit has you covered. You can choose between subscription-based plans or one-time purchases. Plus, we offer volume discounts for larger teams, making it easy to find a cost-effective solution. Explore \u003chighlighted\u003evolume licensing options\u003c/highlighted\u003e.\",\"Can Foxit integrate with other tools or software?\":\"Can Foxit integrate with other tools or software?\",\"Yes! Foxit plays well with others, integrating smoothly with popular tools like Microsoft Office 365, Google Drive, and Salesforce. This means you can easily work with your PDFs right within your favorite apps, saving you time and hassle.\":\"Yes! Foxit plays well with others, integrating smoothly with popular tools like Microsoft Office 365, Google Drive, and Salesforce. This means you can easily work with your PDFs right within your favorite apps, saving you time and hassle.\",\"Does Foxit offer cloud-based PDF solutions?\":\"Does Foxit offer cloud-based PDF solutions?\",\"Yes, Foxit has cloud-based PDF software solutions, like Foxit PDF Editor and Foxit eSign. You can create, store, edit, and share PDFs in the cloud, plus collaborate in real time—all without needing to download extra software.\":\"Yes, Foxit has cloud-based PDF software solutions, like Foxit PDF Editor and Foxit eSign. You can create, store, edit, and share PDFs in the cloud, plus collaborate in real time—all without needing to download extra software.\",\"Does Foxit support batch processing of documents?\":\"Does Foxit support batch processing of documents?\",\"It does! With Foxit PDF Editor, you can batch-process tasks like converting, merging, or compressing multiple PDFs at once. This feature is particularly useful for businesses with lots of documents, helping to complete tasks efficiently and save time.\":\"It does! With Foxit PDF Editor, you can batch-process tasks like converting, merging, or compressing multiple PDFs at once. This feature is particularly useful for businesses with lots of documents, helping to complete tasks efficiently and save time.\",\"Does Foxit support OCR (Optical Character Recognition) technology?\":\"Does Foxit support OCR (Optical Character Recognition) technology?\",\"Yes, Foxit’s OCR feature lets you turn scanned images and PDFs into searchable, editable documents. It’s great for keeping digital records of paper documents, so you can find what you need with just a quick search.\":\"Yes, Foxit’s OCR feature lets you turn scanned images and PDFs into searchable, editable documents. It’s great for keeping digital records of paper documents, so you can find what you need with just a quick search.\",\"Try It Now\":\"Try It Now\",\"Upgrade your Foxit AI Experience\":\"Upgrade your Foxit AI Experience\",\"Unlock unlimited use of instant summaries, rewrites, translations, and more across all your team’s devices.\":\"Unlock unlimited use of instant summaries, rewrites, translations, and more across all your team’s devices.\",\"FOXIT AI\":\"FOXIT AI\",\"************************/esign-pdf/************************start\":\"\",\"Try eSign Essentials\":\"Try eSign Essentials\",\"Please only upload files that end in types .doc .docx .pdf .xlsx .xls .ppt .pptx .csv .txt .rtf .png .jpg .jpeg .ps Please select a new file and try again.\":\"Please only upload files that end in types .doc .docx .pdf .xlsx .xls .ppt .pptx .csv .txt .rtf .png .jpg .jpeg .ps Please select a new file and try again.\",\"The size of total files uploaded in one go should not be more than 50 MB.\":\"The size of total files uploaded in one go should not be more than 50 MB.\",\"or drop file(s) here\":\"or drop file(s) here\",\"Send and Sign Simple Agreements For Free!*\":\"Send and Sign Simple Agreements \u003citalic\u003eFor Free!*\u003c/italic\u003e\",\"*No Foxit account required to sign an agreement or request a signature with this free tool. Signatures collected using this free tool are not legally binding or compliant with eSigning standards. If you need legally binding or compliant eSignature Software, \u003cLinkto\u003eTry Foxit eSign Trial\u003c/Linkto\u003e.\":\"*No Foxit account required to sign an agreement or request a signature with this free tool. Signatures collected using this free tool are not legally binding or compliant with eSigning standards. If you need legally binding or compliant eSignature Software, \u003cLinkto\u003eTry Foxit eSign Trial\u003c/Linkto\u003e.\",\"Upload\":\"Upload\",\"Foxit eSign Essentials and eSign Business\":\"Foxit eSign Essentials and eSign Business\",\"Send, track, sign, notarize, and collect payments.\":\"Send, track, sign, notarize, and collect payments.\",\"************************/esign-pdf/************************end\":\"\",\"******Request a Quote Modale Start******\":\"\",\"highlighted Schedule a Demo\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eSchedule\u003c/highlighted\u003e a Demo\",\"You’re one step away from experiencing the future of digital document management.\":\"You’re \u003chighlighted\u003eone step\u003c/highlighted\u003e away from experiencing the future of digital document management.\",\"Complete this form, and a Foxit representative will be in touch with you to schedule your 1:1 demo.\":\"Complete this form, and a Foxit representative will be in touch with you to schedule your 1:1 demo.\",\"DISCUSS DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT ACROSS YOUR ORGANIZATION\":\"DISCUSS DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT ACROSS YOUR ORGANIZATION\",\"Discover how Foxit’s enterprise-grade PDF tools streamline workflows and enhance productivity, reducing the burden on IT and supporting company-wide efficiency.\":\"Discover how Foxit’s enterprise-grade PDF tools streamline workflows and enhance productivity, reducing the burden on IT and supporting company-wide efficiency.\",\"ENSURE COMPLIANCE AND DATA SECURITY\":\"ENSURE COMPLIANCE AND DATA SECURITY\",\"See how our robust security features and AI-powered tools help your organization meet industry compliance standards and protect sensitive information, offering peace of mind for IT and compliance teams.\":\"See how our robust security features and AI-powered tools help your organization meet industry compliance standards and protect sensitive information, offering peace of mind for IT and compliance teams.\",\"FLEXIBLE, SCALABLE LICENSING OPTIONS\":\"FLEXIBLE, SCALABLE LICENSING OPTIONS\",\"Learn about volume licensing solutions tailored to your organization's needs, with the flexibility to grow as your business and document management requirements evolve.\":\"Learn about volume licensing solutions tailored to your organization's needs, with the flexibility to grow as your business and document management requirements evolve.\",\"Desired Demo Features\":\"Desired Demo Features\",\"Please specify what features you'd like to see in the demo.\":\"Please specify what features you'd like to see in the demo.\",\"Schedule a Demo\":\"Schedule a Demo\",\"******Request a Quote Modale End******\":\"\",\"************************/solution/legal/************************start\":\"\",\"Which Solution is Right for You?\":\"Which Solution is Right for You?\",\"With Foxit, we can sequentially number documents using Bates numbering within subfolders. It arguably saves us two days of work per bundle.\":\"With Foxit, we can sequentially number documents using Bates numbering within subfolders. It arguably saves us two days of work per bundle.\",\"Foxit integrates seamlessly with my other systems and has been quite easy to navigate. My staff loves Foxit much better than Adobe.\":\"Foxit integrates seamlessly with my other systems and has been quite easy to navigate. My staff loves Foxit much better than Adobe.\",\"Foxit PDF Editor was cost-effective, but more importantly, it met or exceeded all of our [law firm’s] needs.\":\"Foxit PDF Editor was cost-effective, but more importantly, it met or exceeded all of our [law firm’s] needs.\",\"Learn More About Security and Compliance\":\"Learn More About Security and Compliance\",\"Making the Case for PDF/A\":\"Making the Case for PDF/A\",\"Best Practices on How to Avoid Rejected Court Filings\":\"Best Practices on How to Avoid Rejected Court Filings\",\"************************/solution/legal/************************end\":\"\",\"************************TryRegisterModal************************start\":\"\",\"CONTINUE\":\"CONTINUE\",\"Since you already have a Foxit Account, you can use your existing account credentials to login.\":\"Since you already have a Foxit Account, you can use your existing account credentials to login.\",\"highlighted Download Foxit PDF Reader\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eDownload\u003c/highlighted\u003e Foxit PDF Reader\",\"************************TryRegisterModal************************end\":\"\",\"We are unable to authenticate your payment method. Please choose a different payment method and try again.\":\"We are unable to authenticate your payment method. Please choose a different payment method and try again.\",\"You just cancelled the payment, if you change your mind, please review the order and try again.\":\"You just cancelled the payment, if you change your mind, please review the order and try again.\",\"Danish\":\"Danish\",\"Dutch\":\"Dutch\",\"Finnish\":\"Finnish\",\"French\":\"French\",\"Japanese\":\"Japanese\",\"Korean\":\"Korean\",\"Chinese-Traditional\":\"Chinese-Traditional\",\"German\":\"German\",\"Italian\":\"Italian\",\"Norwegian\":\"Norwegian\",\"Polish\":\"Polish\",\"Portuguese(Brazil)\":\"Portuguese(Brazil)\",\"Russian\":\"Russian\",\"Spanish\":\"Spanish\",\"Swedish\":\"Swedish\",\"Multi-Language\":\"Multi-Language\",\"Thank you for your order. Shortly thereafter you will receive an order confirmation email that details your order and also contains the order number. Please check your spam box if you do not receive it.\":\"Thank you for your order. \u003cfont\u003eShortly thereafter you will receive an order confirmation email that details your order and also contains the order number. \u003cunderline\u003ePlease check your spam box if you do not receive it.\u003cunderline\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\",\"More time spent on primary work is crucial to growth\":\"More time spent on primary work is crucial to \u003chighlighted\u003egrowth\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"of organizations see AI-powered content solutions as key to improving productivity, collaboration, and knowledge management.\":\"of organizations see \u003chighlighted\u003eAI-powered content solutions\u003c/highlighted\u003e as key to \u003cblod\u003eimproving productivity\u003c/blod\u003e, collaboration, and knowledge management.\",\"By clicking this button, you agree to our Privacy Notice and Disclosure Policy.\":\"By clicking this button, you agree to our \u003cprivacynotice\u003ePrivacy Notice\u003c/privacynotice\u003e and \u003cdisclosurepolicy\u003eDisclosure Policy\u003c/disclosurepolicy\u003e.\",\"************************MetaData************************start\":\"\",\"************************MetaData************************end\":\"\",\"Security Advisories\":\"Security Advisories\",\"*********************Smart Redact Service************************start\":\"\",\"Foxit Connectors are designed to work in tandem with Foxit eSign or Foxit PDF Editor+. You will not be able to purchase Foxit Connectors separately if you remove productName. Would you like to keep both products and continue?\":\"Foxit Connectors are designed to work in tandem with Foxit eSign or Foxit PDF Editor+. You will not be able to purchase Foxit Connectors separately if you remove {{productName}}. Would you like to keep both products and continue?\",\"Remove Both Products\":\"Remove Both Products\",\"For Editor+ Sensitive Data Discovery\":\"For Editor+ \u003cbr/\u003e Sensitive Data Discovery\",\"Foxit Smart Redact Server must be purchased together with Foxit PDF Editor+. Please add both to proceed.\":\"Foxit Smart Redact Server must be purchased together with Foxit PDF Editor+. Please add both to proceed.\",\"This product is not available for purchase in your country/region.\":\"This product is not available for purchase in your country/region.\",\"Your current subscription does not support purchasing Foxit PDF Editor+ without Admin Console.\":\"Your current subscription does not support purchasing Foxit PDF Editor+ without Admin Console.\",\"You already have a Foxit PDF Editor+ subscription.Please click the \\\"Continue\\\" button to purchase Smart Redact Server separately.\":\"You already have a Foxit PDF Editor+ subscription.Please click the \\\"Continue\\\" button to purchase Smart Redact Server separately.\",\"Go to Subscription Management\":\"Go To Subscription Management\",\"Please fill out this volume request form to get a quote from the Foxit sales team.\":\" Please fill out this volume request form to get a quote from the Foxit sales team.\",\"Please fill out the Contact Sales to receive a quote from the Foxit Sales Team for 99+ units.\":\"Please fill out the \u003ccontactLink\u003eContact Sales\u003c/contactLink\u003e to receive a quote from the Foxit Sales Team for 99+ units.\",\"Your purchase amount exceeds the 8-digit limit for online transactions. Please contact Foxit sales at 1-866-680-3668 for offline purchase assistance.\":\"Your purchase amount exceeds the 8-digit limit for online transactions. Please contact Foxit sales at 1-866-680-3668 for offline purchase assistance.\",\"Exceeds the maximum purchase quantity(40) for this product.\":\"Exceeds the maximum purchase quantity(40) for this product.\",\"Get started with Foxit Connectors (New!)\":\"Get started with Foxit Connectors (New!)\",\"Connect Foxit with 40+ of the most popular platforms in the industry for storing files, mapping recipients and sending documents for signature. Connect to platforms like OneDrive, Workday, BambooHR and much more with a click of button, no custom development needed!\":\"Connect Foxit with 40+ of the most popular platforms in the industry for storing files, mapping recipients and sending documents for signature. Connect to platforms like OneDrive, Workday, BambooHR and much more with a click of button, no custom development needed!\",\"Buy with Foxit eSign Business\":\"Buy with Foxit eSign Business\",\"Buy with Foxit eSign Essentials\":\"Buy with Foxit eSign Essentials\",\"Buy with Foxit PDF Editor+\":\"Buy with Foxit PDF Editor+\",\"Featured Platforms:\":\"Featured Platforms:\",\"Foxit Connectors\":\"Foxit Connectors\",\"The Connectors you purchased will give you \\\"credits\\\" to be spent by selecting your Connectors in the eSign.\":\"The Connectors you purchased will give you \\\"credits\\\" to be spent by selecting your Connectors in the eSign.\",\"License assigned to 1 dedicated user. Cannot be reassigned. Cannot be managed by AC.\":\"License assigned to 1 dedicated user. Cannot be reassigned. Cannot be managed by AC.\",\"* Additional charges apply for Foxit Connectors.\":\"* Additional charges apply for Foxit Connectors.\",\"Up to 40 popular platforms\":\"Up to 40 popular platforms\",\"Foxit Connectors are designed to work in tandem with Foxit eSign or Foxit PDF Editor+. Please go back to the previous step to add the combo product and continue.\":\"Foxit Connectors are designed to work in tandem with Foxit eSign or Foxit PDF Editor+. Please go back to the previous step to add the combo product and continue.\",\"The total number of licenses you are managing in the Admin Console.\":\"The total number of licenses you are managing in the Admin Console.\",\"Determines which region's data center is used to save your usage data.\":\"Determines which region's data center is used to save your usage data.\",\"The list of regions is limited to align with your previous purchase of Foxit PDF Editor+ for data alignment purposes.\":\"The list of regions is limited to align with your previous purchase of Foxit PDF Editor+ for data alignment purposes.\",\"The list of regions is limited to align with your Foxit Account for data alignment purposes.\":\"The list of regions is limited to align with your Foxit Account for data alignment purposes.\",\"*********************Smart Redact Service************************end\":\"\",\"Special Offer for Users\":\"Special Offer for \u003clogo\u003e\u003c/logo\u003e Users\",\"Buy now to get 20% off your first year when you purchase 10-30 licenses.\":\"Buy now to get \u003chighlighted\u003e20% off your first year\u003c/highlighted\u003e when you purchase \u003chighlighted\u003e10-30 licenses.\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Sign in to your Foxit account required. Your files will be securely handled by Foxit servers. By using this service, you agree to Foxit's AI User Guidelines and Privacy Policy. Learn more about Foxit AI Assistant's Security and Privacy.\":\"Sign in to your Foxit account required. Your files will be securely handled by Foxit servers. By using this service, you agree to Foxit's \u003clink_ai_user_guidelines\u003eAI User Guidelines\u003c/link_ai_user_guidelines\u003e and \u003clink_privacy_policy\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/link_privacy_policy\u003e. Learn more about Foxit AI Assistant's \u003clink_ai_assistant\u003eSecurity and Privacy\u003c/link_ai_assistant\u003e.\",\"For additional details see our AI Credit Usage Policy page.\":\"For additional details see our \u003chighlighted\u003eAI Credit Usage Policy page\u003c/highlighted\u003e.\",\"At Foxit, your privacy is our top priority. Our AI solutions are built with robust security protocols to ensure that your data is processed securely and is not retained after use. For detailed information on our data protection and privacy practices, please refer to https://www.foxit.com/company/ai-assistant-security-privacy/.\":\"At Foxit, your privacy is our top priority. Our AI solutions are built with robust security protocols to ensure that your data is processed securely and is not retained after use. For detailed information on our data protection and privacy practices, please refer to \u003chighlighted\u003ehttps://www.foxit.com/{{locale}}/company/ai-assistant-security-privacy/\u003c/highlighted\u003e.\",\"Foxit PDF AI Assistant\":\"Foxit PDF \u003chighlighted\u003eAI Assistant\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"New and Trending From Foxit\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eNew and Trending\u003c/highlighted\u003e From Foxit\",\"Try It Today with Foxit PDF Editor+\":\"Try It Today with \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit PDF Editor+\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Video Tutorials\":\"Video \u003chighlighted\u003eTutorials\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"AI-Driven Productivity for Smarter Workflows\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eAI-Driven Productivity\u003c/highlighted\u003e for Smarter Workflows\",\"Learn How AI Can Boost Productivity By 61%\":\"Learn How AI Can \u003chighlighted\u003eBoost Productivity By 61%\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Includes Access to Foxit Workspace:\":\"Includes Access to \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit Workspace\u003c/highlighted\u003e:\",\"Save 12+ hours per week with AI-powered summarization—Gain time to focus on strategy, decision-making, and the work that truly matters.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eSave 12+ hours per week with AI-powered summarization—\u003c/highlighted\u003eGain time to focus on strategy, decision-making, and the work that truly matters.\",\"Powerful AI Solutions to Enhance Workflows\":\"Powerful AI Solutions\u003cbr/\u003eto \u003chighlighted\u003eEnhance Workflows\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"PDF AI Assistant\":\"PDF AI Assistant\",\"Smart Redact\":\"Smart Redact\",\"AI for Admin Console\":\"AI for \u003chighlighted\u003eAdmin Console\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Foxit AI Privacy and Security\":\"Foxit AI Privacy and\u003cbr/\u003eSecurity\",\"Get Started with Foxit AI Tools\":\"Get Started with \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit AI Tools\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"For a comprehensive overview, refer to our Foxit AI Assistant Security Webpage\":\"For a comprehensive overview, refer to our \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit AI Assistant Security Webpage\u003c/highlighted\u003e.\",\"************************SmartRedact************************start\":\"\",\"highlighted Smart Redact - AI PDF Redaction Software\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eSmart Redact\u003c/highlighted\u003e \u003cbr\u003eAI PDF Redaction Software\",\"AI-Powered PII Redaction in One Click\":\"\u003cp\u003eAI-Powered PII Redaction in One Click\u003c/p\u003e\",\"Automatically detect and remove sensitive data like names, addresses, and IDs without templates or manual review. Built into Foxit PDF Editor for seamless, secure redaction.\":\"Automatically detect and remove sensitive data like names, addresses, and IDs without templates or manual review. Built into Foxit PDF Editor for seamless, secure redaction.\",\"Achieve Unmatched Efficiency with 99.9% Accuracy Using AI\":\"Achieve Unmatched Efficiency \u003cbr\u003e\u003chighlighted\u003ewith 99.9% Accuracy Using AI\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"highlighted Redact Sensitive PII in PDFs with AI Efficiency\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eRedact Sensitive PII in PDFs \u003c/highlighted\u003e with AI Efficiency\",\"highlighted Smart Redact FAQ\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eSmart Redact\u003c/highlighted\u003e FAQ\",\"How many documents comes with Smart Redact?\":\"How many documents comes with Smart Redact?\",\"Once Editor+ is purchased, users receive a quota of 50 documents. After exceeding this limit, additional plans are available through in-app purchase:\":\"Once Editor+ is purchased, users receive a quota of 50 documents. After exceeding this limit, additional plans are available through in-app purchase:\",\"Standard - 200 docs/year\":\"Standard - 200 docs/year\",\"Pro - 1,000 docs/year\":\"Pro - 1,000 docs/year\",\"Enterprise - 2,400 docs/year\":\"Enterprise - 2,400 docs/year\",\"Is Smart Redact secure?\":\"Is Smart Redact secure?\",\"Yes. Foxit Smart Redact ensures top-tier data protection with TAA compliance and SOC2 certification, so your information remains secure. Hosted on Azure and safeguarded with AES-256 encryption, all data transmissions between the Foxit cloud and our PDF Editor are fully protected. After the analysis is complete, files are securely processed in the cloud for redaction. Once redaction is finished, all files are automatically deleted, ensuring they are no longer accessible.\":\"Yes. Foxit Smart Redact ensures top-tier data protection with TAA compliance and SOC2 certification, so your information remains secure. Hosted on Azure and safeguarded with AES-256 encryption, all data transmissions between the Foxit cloud and our PDF Editor are fully protected. After the analysis is complete, files are securely processed in the cloud for redaction. Once redaction is finished, all files are automatically deleted, ensuring they are no longer accessible.\",\"Do I need a PDF Editor+ subscription to use Smart Redact?\":\"Do I need a PDF Editor+ subscription to use Smart Redact?\",\"Yes. Smart Redact is only available with a Foxit PDF Editor+ subscription. If you're using the standard version of Foxit PDF Editor or a perpetual license, you won't see the Smart Redact feature. Is it time for an upgrade? Login to your account or contact a sales rep today!\":\"Yes. Smart Redact is only available with a Foxit PDF Editor+ subscription. If you're using the standard version of Foxit PDF Editor or a perpetual license, you won't see the Smart Redact feature. Is it time for an upgrade? Login to your account or contact a sales rep today!\",\"What types of data can Smart Redact detect?\":\"What types of data can Smart Redact detect?\",\"Smart Redact can automatically detect personally identifiable information (PII) like names, Social Security numbers, phone numbers, emails, credit card details, and more. You can also set up custom keywords or phrases to target anything else specific to your documents.\":\"Smart Redact can automatically detect personally identifiable information (PII) like names, Social Security numbers, phone numbers, emails, credit card details, and more. You can also set up custom keywords or phrases to target anything else specific to your documents.\",\"Can I preview what gets redacted before it's final?\":\"Can I preview what gets redacted before it's final?\",\"Absolutely. Smart Redact gives you a full preview of suggested redactions before anything is applied. You can review, edit, or remove items — so you stay in control of what gets blacked out.\":\"Absolutely. Smart Redact gives you a full preview of suggested redactions before anything is applied. You can review, edit, or remove items — so you stay in control of what gets blacked out.\",\"highlighted Try It Today \u003cbr\u003ewith Foxit PDF Editor+\":\"Try It Today with \u003cbr\u003e\u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit PDF Editor+\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"************************SmartRedact************************end\":\"\",\"************************SmartPrompts************************start\":\"\",\"For more information, visit our Security and Privacy page at: https://www.foxit.com/company/ai-assistant-security-privacy/\":\"For more information, visit our Security and Privacy page at: \u003clinkto\u003ehttps://www.foxit.com/{{locale}}/company/ai-assistant-security-privacy/\u003c/linkto\u003e\",\"************************SmartPrompts************************end\":\"\",\"Translate PDF\":\"Translate PDF\",\"*********************ai/credits-usage-policy/*********************start\":\"\",\"AI Credit Usage Policy\":\"AI Credit \u003chighlighted\u003eUsage Policy\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Foxit AI Assistant and Foxit Workspace utilizes a credit-based system for interactions with AI-powered tools. Credits are deducted based on usage, including submitting text prompts, selecting suggested prompts, or using AI-powered features within the defined limits.\":\"Foxit AI Assistant and Foxit Workspace utilizes a credit-based system for interactions with AI-powered tools. Credits are deducted based on usage, including submitting text prompts, selecting suggested prompts, or using AI-powered features within the defined limits.\",\"Foxit AI Assistant, available within Foxit Editor subscriptions and Foxit Reader, and Foxit Workspace utilize a credit-based system for interactions with AI-powered tools. Credits are deducted based on usage, including submitting text prompts, selecting suggested prompts, or using AI-powered features within the defined limits. Credit consumption is based on the complexity of the task, the user prompt, and the document size, so a single task will not always consume the same number of credits.\":\"Foxit AI Assistant, available within Foxit Editor subscriptions and Foxit Reader, and \u003cworkspace\u003eFoxit Workspace\u003c/workspace\u003e utilize a credit-based system for interactions with AI-powered tools. Credits are deducted based on usage, including submitting text prompts, selecting suggested prompts, or using AI-powered features within the defined limits. Credit consumption is based on the complexity of the task, the user prompt, and the document size, so a single task will not always consume the same number of credits.\",\"Credit Allocation\":\"Credit \u003chighlighted\u003eAllocation\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Foxit AI Assistant in our subscription Reader and Editor productions, along with our standalone AI platform Foxit Workspace, share a common credit pool. Credit allocation is as follows:\":\"Foxit AI Assistant in our subscription Reader and Editor productions, along with our standalone AI platform Foxit Workspace, share a common credit pool. Credit allocation is as follows:\",\"Foxit AI Assistant in our subscription Editor and Reader products, along with Foxit Workspace, share a common credit pool. Credit allocation is as follows:\":\"Foxit AI Assistant in our subscription Editor and Reader products, along with Foxit Workspace, share a common credit pool. Credit allocation is as follows:\",\"Free Credits: 20 free credits per month.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eFree Credits:\u003c/highlighted\u003e 20 free credits per month.\",\"Free Credits: 300 free credits per month.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eFree Credits:\u003c/highlighted\u003e 300 free credits per month.\",\"Paid Credits: 2,000 credits per month.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003ePaid Credits:\u003c/highlighted\u003e 2,000 credits per month.\",\"AI Extra Credit Pack: 1,000 additional credits available for purchase. Available only to users with an active AI subscription. Extra Credit Pack credits do not reset monthly and roll over month to month, and do not expire unless the user cancels their AI subscription.\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eAI Extra Credit Pack:\u003c/highlighted\u003e 1,000 additional credits available for purchase. Available only to users with an active AI subscription. Extra Credit Pack credits do not reset monthly and roll over month to month, and do not expire unless the user cancels their AI subscription.\",\"Credit Usage by Feature\":\"Credit Usage by \u003chighlighted\u003eFeature\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Credit consumption is tied to the actual cost of each task rather than a fixed amount per action. Since not every feature costs the same number of credits, usage will vary by feature, by prompt, and by document size. Users can review their detailed credit usage at any time under \u003cbold\u003eSettings \u003e Usage\u003c/bold\u003e.\":\"Credit consumption is tied to the actual cost of each task rather than a fixed amount per action. Since not every feature costs the same number of credits, usage will vary by feature, by prompt, and by document size. Users can review their detailed credit usage at any time under \u003cbold\u003eSettings \u003e Usage\u003c/bold\u003e.\",\"File Limitations\":\"File \u003chighlighted\u003eLimitations\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Supports upload of PDF, PNG, and JPG files.\":\"Supports upload of PDF, PNG, and JPG files.\",\"PDFs have no MB file size limit; up to 2,000 pages can be processed.\":\"PDFs have no MB file size limit; up to 2,000 pages can be processed.\",\"Images are limited to 20 MB and must be PNG or JPG.\":\"Images are limited to 20 MB and must be PNG or JPG.\",\"Up to 100 files per project.\":\"Up to 100 files per project.\",\"Each file can be up to 100 MB or 2,000 pages.\":\"Each file can be up to 100 MB or 2,000 pages.\",\"Up to 1 GB total storage per project.\":\"Up to 1 GB total storage per project.\",\"No file count or per-file size limit. PDFs support up to 2,000 pages per file.\":\"No file count or per-file size limit. PDFs support up to 2,000 pages per file.\",\"Supported formats: PDF, Word, Excel, PPT, URL, TXT, MD, JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP, and SVG.\":\"Supported formats: PDF, Word, Excel, PPT, URL, TXT, MD, JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP, and SVG.\",\"Foxit PDF Editor Subscription Models and PDF Reader\":\"Foxit PDF Editor Subscription Models and PDF Reader\",\"Each AI Assistant action that is executed uses a 1 credit, regardless of the complexity or length of the task.\":\"Each AI Assistant action that is executed uses a 1 credit, regardless of the complexity or length of the task.\",\"Foxit Workspace\":\"Foxit Workspace\",\"Each prompt/question submitted depletes 1 credit.\":\"Each prompt/question submitted depletes 1 credit.\",\"Additional Notes\":\"Additional \u003chighlighted\u003eNotes\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Foxit AI Assistant is currently an add-on feature available for use within Foxit PDF Editor Subscriptions, Foxit PDF Reader, and Foxit Workspace.\":\"Foxit AI Assistant is currently an add-on feature available for use within Foxit PDF Editor Subscriptions, Foxit PDF Reader, and Foxit Workspace.\",\"Foxit AI is currently an add-on available for use within Foxit Editor subscriptions, Foxit Reader, and Foxit Workspace.\":\"Foxit AI is currently an add-on available for use within Foxit Editor subscriptions, Foxit Reader, and Foxit Workspace.\",\"Credits reset monthly based on the subscription cycle.\":\"Credits reset monthly based on the subscription cycle.\",\"Subscription credits (free and paid) reset monthly based on the subscription cycle. Extra Credit Pack credits do not reset and roll over month to month.\":\"Subscription credits (free and paid) reset monthly based on the subscription cycle. Extra Credit Pack credits do not reset and roll over month to month.\",\"Credit pooling is available for enterprise customers via the Admin Console.\":\"Credit pooling is available for enterprise customers via the Admin Console.\",\"If all credits are depleted, AI-powered features within the AI Assistant tab or within the Foxit Workspace platform will be unavailable until the next reset.\":\"If all credits are depleted, AI-powered features within the AI Assistant tab or within the Foxit Workspace platform will be unavailable until the next reset.\",\"If all credits are depleted, AI-powered features within the AI Assistant tab or within Foxit Workspace will be unavailable until the next reset, unless the user has Extra Credit Pack credits available.\":\"If all credits are depleted, AI-powered features within the AI Assistant tab or within Foxit Workspace will be unavailable until the next reset, unless the user has Extra Credit Pack credits available.\",\"Credit usage policies are subject to change based on feature updates and enhancements.\":\"Credit usage policies are subject to change based on feature updates and enhancements.\",\"For further details or support, please visit Foxit Support.\":\"For further details or support, please visit \u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit Support\u003c/highlighted\u003e.\",\"*********************ai/credits-usage-policy/*********************end\":\"\",\"Enhance Your Workflow with Foxit Integrations\":\"Enhance Your Workflow with\u003cbr/\u003e\u003chighlighted\u003eFoxit Integrations\u003c/highlighted\u003e\",\"Transform your Google Drive into the perfect starting point for secure eSignature workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors. Effortlessly pull contracts, agreements, or forms from Drive, send them for digital signatures within Foxit eSign, and automatically sync completed files back to their original folders—all without leaving the tools you already know. Manage everything on Foxit eSign’s powerful cloud platform, ensuring your workflows stay smooth, organized, and compliant.\":\"Transform your Google Drive into the perfect starting point for secure eSignature workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors. Effortlessly pull contracts, agreements, or forms from Drive, send them for digital signatures within Foxit eSign, and automatically sync completed files back to their original folders—all without leaving the tools you already know. Manage everything on Foxit eSign’s powerful cloud platform, ensuring your workflows stay smooth, organized, and compliant.\",\"Simplify your HR and payroll operations with the Foxit eSign Connector for ADP Workforce Now. Prepare, send, and track employee agreements or payroll forms using Foxit eSign’s electronic signature app, ensuring every document is signed securely and automatically synced back to ADP Workforce Now for streamlined recordkeeping and compliance.\":\"Simplify your HR and payroll operations with the Foxit eSign Connector for ADP Workforce Now. Prepare, send, and track employee agreements or payroll forms using Foxit eSign’s electronic signature app, ensuring every document is signed securely and automatically synced back to ADP Workforce Now for streamlined recordkeeping and compliance.\",\"Optimize recruiting with Foxit eSign Connectors for Avature. Easily send offer letters, candidate agreements, and compliance forms for electronic contract signing, then sync signed documents back into Avature for smooth hiring workflows. Keep recruitment processes fast, organized, and professional.\":\"Optimize recruiting with Foxit eSign Connectors for Avature. Easily send offer letters, candidate agreements, and compliance forms for electronic contract signing, then sync signed documents back into Avature for smooth hiring workflows. Keep recruitment processes fast, organized, and professional.\",\"Streamline HR workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for BambooHR. Effortlessly send offer letters, onboarding documents, and compliance forms using electronic signature forms, and let completed files sync back automatically. With this connector, you eliminate manual steps and focus on creating a seamless employee experience.\":\"Streamline HR workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for BambooHR. Effortlessly send offer letters, onboarding documents, and compliance forms using electronic signature forms, and let completed files sync back automatically. With this connector, you eliminate manual steps and focus on creating a seamless employee experience.\",\"Make Box the center of your document signing workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors. Pull contracts, agreements, or other critical documents directly from Box into Foxit eSign to prepare, send, and manage electronic contract signing. Completed files are synced back to Box automatically, helping your team stay organized, efficient, and focused on what matters most.\":\"Make Box the center of your document signing workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors. Pull contracts, agreements, or other critical documents directly from Box into Foxit eSign to prepare, send, and manage electronic contract signing. Completed files are synced back to Box automatically, helping your team stay organized, efficient, and focused on what matters most.\",\"Simplify hiring workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for Breezy HR. Send offer letters, candidate agreements, and onboarding documents for online contract signing, and automatically sync signed files back into Breezy HR. This Connector keeps your recruitment process fast, professional, and compliant.\":\"Simplify hiring workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for Breezy HR. Send offer letters, candidate agreements, and onboarding documents for online contract signing, and automatically sync signed files back into Breezy HR. This Connector keeps your recruitment process fast, professional, and compliant.\",\"Empower your staffing and recruiting workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for Bullhorn. Prepare client contracts, candidate agreements, and compliance forms for contract lifecycle management, ensuring they’re signed and stored securely. Keep everything streamlined and accessible to deliver exceptional experiences to clients and candidates.\":\"Empower your staffing and recruiting workflows with Foxit eSign Connectors for Bullhorn. Prepare client contracts, candidate agreements, and compliance forms for contract lifecycle management, ensuring they’re signed and stored securely. Keep everything streamlined and accessible to deliver exceptional experiences to clients and candidates.\",\"Optimize your workforce management with Foxit eSign Connectors for Ceridian Dayforce. Pull employment agreements, payroll forms, or compliance records into Foxit eSign, send them for secure signature, and automatically sync the completed documents back to Dayforce. Create a seamless contract lifecycle management system that saves time and ensures accuracy.\":\"Optimize your workforce management with Foxit eSign Connectors for Ceridian Dayforce. Pull employment agreements, payroll forms, or compliance records into Foxit eSign, send them for secure signature, and automatically sync the completed documents back to Dayforce. Create a seamless contract lifecycle management system that saves time and ensures accuracy.\",\"Simplify employee management with Foxit eSign Connectors for Cezanne HR. Manage agreements, onboarding paperwork, and compliance records with ease using contract lifecycle management software. Completed documents integrate directly back into Cezanne HR, helping your team stay compliant and organized effortlessly.\":\"Simplify employee management with Foxit eSign Connectors for Cezanne HR. Manage agreements, onboarding paperwork, and compliance records with ease using contract lifecycle management software. Completed documents integrate directly back into Cezanne HR, helping your team stay compliant and organized effortlessly.\",\"Manage global teams effortlessly with Foxit eSign Connectors for Deel. Prepare, send, and track global contractor agreements within Foxit eSign, ensuring every signature is secure and every document is automatically synced back to Deel. Simplify compliance and efficiency for your international hiring and payroll processes.\":\"Manage global teams effortlessly with Foxit eSign Connectors for Deel. Prepare, send, and track global contractor agreements within Foxit eSign, ensuring every signature is secure and every document is automatically synced back to Deel. Simplify compliance and efficiency for your international hiring and payroll processes.\",\"Turn your Dropbox into an eSignature powerhouse with Foxit eSign Connectors. Access contracts or agreements stored in Dropbox, send them for signatures using electronic signature forms, 