 organized.\",\"Recipient Signing Experience | Foxit eSign\":\"Recipient Signing Experience | Foxit eSign\",\"Make signing effortless for recipients. Guided completion, multi-channel access, Signer AI help, and secure legally binding eSignatures with Foxit eSign.\":\"Make signing effortless for recipients. Guided completion, multi-channel access, Signer AI help, and secure legally binding eSignatures with Foxit eSign.\",\"In-Person Signing | Foxit eSign\":\"In-Person Signing | Foxit eSign\",\"Capture signatures in person with Foxit eSign. Host face-to-face signing sessions, kiosk and forms workflows, and keep every signed record secure and auditable.\":\"Capture signatures in person with Foxit eSign. Host face-to-face signing sessions, kiosk and forms workflows, and keep every signed record secure and auditable.\",\"Bulk Signing | Foxit eSign\":\"Bulk Signing | Foxit eSign\",\"Sign multiple documents at once with Foxit eSign Bulk Signing. Clear signing queues faster while keeping control over every approval.\":\"Sign multiple documents at once with Foxit eSign Bulk Signing. Clear signing queues faster while keeping control over every approval.\",\"Audit Trail \u0026 Signature Certificates | Foxit eSign\":\"Audit Trail \u0026 Signature Certificates | Foxit eSign\",\"Keep proof with every signature. Foxit eSign audit trails and signature certificates capture signing events, timestamps, and verification details for compliance.\":\"Keep proof with every signature. Foxit eSign audit trails and signature certificates capture signing events, timestamps, and verification details for compliance.\",\"Signer AI - AI-Powered eSigning Assistant | Foxit eSign\":\"Signer AI - AI-Powered eSigning Assistant | Foxit eSign\",\"Signer AI by Foxit eSign helps signers understand, translate, and interact with documents in real time. Reduce drop-off and boost completion rates with AI-powered eSigning.\":\"Signer AI by Foxit eSign helps signers understand, translate, and interact with documents in real time. Reduce drop-off and boost completion rates with AI-powered eSigning.\",\"Sign\":\"Sign\",\"Store\":\"Store\",\"eSignature App\":\"eSignature App\",\"Tracking and Reminders\":\"Tracking and Reminders\",\"Identity Authentication\":\"Identity Authentication\",\"eSign + DMS\":\"eSign + DMS\",\"Legality by Country\":\"Legality by Country\",\"eSign Connectors\":\"eSign Connectors\",\"eSign for Salesforce\":\"eSign for Salesforce\",\"Knowledge Base \u0026 Tutorials\":\"Knowledge Base \u0026 Tutorials\",\"vs. Adobe Sign\":\"vs. Adobe Sign\",\"vs. DocuSign\":\"vs. DocuSign\",\"vs. PandaDoc\":\"vs. PandaDoc\",\"View Plans\":\"View Plans\",\"No articles are available.\":\"Es sind keine Artikel verfügbar.\",\"Back to Top\":\"Back to Top\",\"\u003chighlighted\u003eTry\u003c/highlighted\u003e Foxit Workspace\":\"\u003chighlighted\u003eTry\u003c/highlighted\u003e Foxit Workspace\",\"Change email\":\"Change email\",\"Failed to check email. Please try again.\":\"Failed to check email. Please try again.\",\"Free trial failed\":\"Free trial failed\",\"Input character exceeds limit\":\"Input character exceeds limit\",\"Please select your country/region.\":\"Please select your country/region.\",\"Support Portal\":\"Support Portal\",\"Terms of Service\":\"Terms of Service\",\"Thank you for your interest in Foxit Workspace.\":\"Thank you for your interest in Foxit Workspace.\",\"Your download should start automatically. If it doesn’t, click here to download Foxit Workspace manually.\":\"Your download should start automatically. If it doesn’t, click \u003chighlighted\u003ehere\u003c/highlighted\u003e to download Foxit Workspace manually.\",\"Foxit includes 300 free AI credits each month, which you can use for PDF translation and all other Foxit AI tools. Each translation deducts credits based on the task complexity and the model used. If you need more capacity, upgrade to a plan with 2,000 monthly credits. See our \u003chighlighted\u003eAI Credit Usage Policy\u003c/highl